<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1AKA - Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Akabambu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu su utumbuli sa Akabambu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Akabambu Akolongu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Akab</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu sukutumbuli sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akabambu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya Akabambu 1 na Akabambu 2 pakwatumbulia sabia kitabu simu kikolongu. Kwa mala jukutumbuli ndi sabaganwa na kuba itabu ibeli mu litoleu li Kieblania lebilikema Seputuaginti, lelule ndi labii litoleu la mwandi ngani mu lugha jikigiliki kwi lilaganu la mwandi. Ngasekumanyiki ngati nyani jojuandiki itabu ya Akabambu ba 1 na Akabambu 2 au kuibeka mipangu gogubii naku. Jojaandika itabu yakabambu jatumi balua isokopi ya mwandi ili kuiandika, linga mu lipungu la 1 Akabambu 11:41, na 14:19, na 14:29 ngati malenganu gagalangi usakaka hogu. Kabee ngasekumanyika itabu heyi iandikwi lili au ndi yabekwa lii mupangu waki. Ndi kulangi sakaka kubanga yajomuka kuandikwa kipindi bambu Yekonia paandekakia kuhuma kuluhami ku Babeli mu saka sa 561 kabula jukusaliwa Kilisitu, ndaba lijambu heli liandikwi mu kitabu sa 2 Akabambu 25:27. Asomi bingi ba majambu ga Bibilia ahobale kubanga pandu pakolongu pi itabu yenge yaandikwi yaka yingi kabula ji kipindi hesi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya Akabambu 1 na Akabambu 2 ilandi majambu gaka kila bambu juku Izilaeli na Yuda tumbuka kipindi pajwalongua bambu nkolongu Solomoni, kipindi bandu bi milema mibeli heji pajabiya jakoni jiunganiki. Itabu ya Akabambu 1 na Akabambu 2 ilandi ubambu uku Izilaeli gowaunganiki namuna ewabaganika na kuba ubambu ubeli na kila ubambu wapwata namuna jaki juulongosi, mbaka bambu heyi payasindwa na bandu bimilema jengi na bandu baki kwaahamisa nakwaapeleka kuluhami. Jojaandika jalingalia ngani namuna kila ubambu anawapwatiki malagalaki gaka Sapanga sa sakaka au ngasewapwatiki. Akabambu asokopi “Bahengiki gamboni palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga” linga mulipungu la 2 Akabambu 18:3. Bangi bahengiki, “majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga” linga mulipungu la 2 Akabambu 21:2. Jojaandika jusimuli hotuhotu majambu gaka bambu babahengiki gamboni palongi jaka Sapanga nu kulangi hotuhotu kubanga kuwesa kwa kila nndema kwalengana nu kuhobaleka kwaka bambu hoju palongi jaka Sapanga. Mulipungu 2 Akabambu 17:7, Aizilaeli baakamwi nukujenda nndema kuluhami kuba atumwa kwa ndaba yenze, “Gapitila haga ndaba Aizilaeli babiya ahengiki mahakau palongi jaka Sapanga” na kwa ndaba “Biilumbali isapanga yengi.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabi nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Mu lipungu la 1-11 lilandi namuna bambu Solomoni mwana waka Daudi ejawesa kuba bambu na majambu gu ulongosi waki gu ubambu namuna ewajongana.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu lipungu la 12-16 lilandi kubaganika ku ubambu uku Izilaeli nu ubambu uku Yuda na akabambu bi milema jibeli heji.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu lipungu la 17-19 lilandi namuna nndota Eliya ejabiya juhenga majambu gaki, ngani je kulandi namuna bambu nkolongu Ahabu ejabiya juhutana na Eliya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu lipungu la 20-22 lilandi mwisu ulongosi waka bambu nkolongu Ahabu na Izilaeli, na majambu gakabambu bangi babalongua badala jaki, pamu na majambu ga akabambu buku Yuda.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Daudi mu useja waki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Kipindi hesi Bambu nkolongu Daudi jwabiya nseja ngani, akatumisi baki bunhyekalia kwi libulangeti, lakini hata hela ngase jwawesa kupata lyotu. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Ndienu atumisi baki bumpwagila, “Wabambu nkolongu witu, nambanga tugutaputi kamwali jwangakuwai kugone na mwanalomi jugutumakia nukugutunza, jugonila pulutengu jaku ili guwesa kupata lyotu.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ndipala bataputa kamwali jojunyambiki kati ja bandu Aizilaeli boti, jwapatikana kamwali jumwa jojunyambiki joankemika Abishagi, kuhuma ku musi uku Shunami, nabombi bumpelika kwaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Kamwali hoju, jwanyambiki ngamaa. Ndienu jwatumbulia kuntumaki nukuntunza bambu nkolongu, lakini bambu nkolongu ngase jwagoni naku.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya jupala kuba bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Kipindi hesi, Adonia mwana waka Daudi, jojuwe anyongo baki baakemika Hagiti, jatumbulia kuligamba sukupwaga, “Nepeni ndi nenibiya bambu nkolongu.” Ndienu, jiliandalia magali gukuhutwa na falasi na bandu baakwelale falasi pamu na bandu hamusini babundongulia koni ajombateka. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Lakini atati baki ngase bawaiki kundosa mwanamundu, “Boo, ndaba jaki guhengiki hela”? Adoniya jwabii nkombu jojunyambiki ngani, na jabiya nnuna waka Abisalumu. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya jalongila majambu na Yoabu mwana waka Seluya, nu nngolu Abiatali, nabombi bajetakiya kunnzangati. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Lakini nngolu Sadoki na Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, na nndota Nasani na Shimei na Lei pamu na akalonda baka Daudi ngasebabi pamu na Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Lisoba limu Adoniya jwapiya litambiku lilikondoo, na ng'ombi na matoli gagakendiki ku lilibu la Zoheleti, pambipi na pandu papatimbilikana masi pabapakema Enilogeli. Jaakoka akalongu baki boti baka bambu nkolongu Daudi, na akanalomi boti buku Yuda bababiya akakilongosi baka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />Lakini Adoniya ngaseakokiki, nndota Nasani na Benaya na akalonda baka bambu akolongu na Solomoni nndongu waki.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni anhimika kuba bambu nkolongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Ndienu, Nasani jajenda kwaka Batisheba amabu baka Solomoni, andalukia, boo, ngase gujowini kubanga Adoniya mwana waka Hagiti, jilihengiti kuba bambu nkolongo na bambu witu Daudi ngasejumanyiki lijambu hele? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Henu anagupala kulilamisa kutama kwaku wamweti nukulamisa kutama kwaka mwana waku Solomoni, guhenga ana, <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Gujenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Daudi, gukundalukiya ana, wabambu nkolongu wangu, ngase wanapi nepani nutumisi waku kupwaga, “Mwana waku Solomoni jwiilongusa badala jangune na jwiitama panani jikiteu sangu su ulongose.” Enukubii bolee mbona Adoniya julihengiki kuba bambu nkolongu badala jangu nepane? <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Na ewibiya wakona gulonge na bambu nkolongu, “Nepani niijingala nukupwaga gajulongi haga ga sakaka.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Ndienu, Batisheba jajenda kusumba jaka bambu nkolongu. Kipindi sesela bambu nkolongu jwabii nseja ngani, najombi Abishagi kamwali jwa musi uku Shunami jwabia jutenda kuntunza. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Batisheba jwajinama, nukungungamali bambu nkolongu, najombi bambu nkolongu andalukia, “Gupala kyane?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Batisheba jwajibua, “Wabambu wangu wanapila nepani nutumisi waku palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga waku, kupwaga, ‘Mwana waku Solomoni jwiilongusa badala jangune na jwiitama panani jikiteu sangu su ubambu ukolongu.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Henu gulinga, Adoniya jutenda kulongosa hata ngati wehapa wabambu nkolongu witu ngasegumanyiki majambu haga. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Jupiiki matambiku ga ng'ombi, na makondoo gingi na matoli gagakendiki, na jwaakokiki bana boti baka bambu nkolongu, nngolu Abiatali, na Yoabu nu nkolongu jwa akaalonda, lakini ntumisi waku Solomoni ngaseakokiki. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Henu sajenu wabambu nkolongu wangu, Aizilaeli boti atenda kugulendale, ili waapwagila nya jojibia bambu nkolongu badala jako wabambu nkolongu wangu. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Anangahela, kipindi pe wabambu nkolongu wangu pawikuwa, nepani pamu na mwana wangu Solomoni batubalanga kuba tubii na makosa.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Kipindi Batisheba pajwabiya julongee na bambu nkolongu, nndota Nasani jwajingala mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Nabombi bandu bumpwagila bambu nkolongu, “Nndota Nasani jubii pamba.” Najwombi Nasani pabunhikila bambu nkolongu, japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Ndienu Nasani japwaga, “Boo wabambu nkolongu wangu, watangasa lee, Adoniya ndi jwiibiya bambu nkolongu badala jaku nukubanga jwiitama pikiteu saku su ubambu ukolongo? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Ndaba lelenu juheli nukupia matambiku ga ng'ombi na makondoo gingi na matoli gagakendiki na jwaakemiki bana baku boti akanalomi, Yoabu nkolongu wa akalonda na nngolu Abiatali. Ndienu, akula na kunywa palongi jaki, koni apwaaga, ‘Gutama masoba gingi wabambu nkolongu Adoniya!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Lakini ngasejwangokiki nepani, nuntumisi waku wala nngolu Sadoki wala Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada wala mwana waku Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Boo, goti aga ugahengiki wehapa wabambu wangu, bambu nkolongu, sanga kwaapwagi akatumisi baku mundu jojitama pikiteu saku su ubambu ukolongu bambu wangu badala jako?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Najombi bambu nkolongu Daudi jwajibua, “Nngemila Batisheba.” Batisheba jwahika kuka bambu nkolongu nukujema palongi jaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ndipala bambu nkolongu jwapwaaga, “Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga jojahokwi womi wangu kuhuma mu mang'aliku goti ganaketangini naku mu kutama kwangu, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />sakaka isinhenga lelenu sela senugulapila palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa bandu Aizilaeli napwaga, ‘Mwana waku Solomoni jwiilongusa badala jangu nepani, na jwiitama pikiteu sangu su ubambu badala jangu paniikuwa.’”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ndipala Batisheba japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai, angungamalia bambu nkolongu, nu kupwaga “Wabambu wangu, bambu nkolongu Daudi, gutama masoba goti!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Daudi jwapaga, “Ngemila nngolu Sadoki nu nndota Nasani na Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada.” Nabombi bahika kwaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />Najombi bambu nkolongu jwaapwagila, “Mwaajukua atumisi baka bambu nkolongu winu na mukunkwelisa mwana wangu Solomoni panani ja falasi mukahelala naku mbaka pandu papatimbilikana masi ku Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Hoku nngolu Sadoki nu nndota Nasani bukunnzakania mahuta ili kunhimika jubiya bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, mwenikatai mwiijemba imbata nukupwaga, ‘Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jutama masoba goti!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Ndienu mwiikwela naku, najombi jiihika nukutama pikiteu sangu su ubambu ukolongu nukulongosa badala jangu. Hoju ndi jonunhagwi jwaalongusa bandu Aizilaeli na bandu buku Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Ndienu Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada pajunzibua bambu nkolongu, “Henaa! Bambu Sapanga waka bambu nkolongu wangu juhenga ngati hegupwagiki. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Ngati Bambu Sapanga ejabii pamu na bambu nkolongu wangu, jubiya kabee na Solomoni, na juguhenga ubambu waki ubiya na makili nu jubiya bambu nkolongu kupeta wehapa wa bambu nkolongu wangu Daudi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Ndienu nngolu Sadoki, nndota Nasani na Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, na Wakelesi na Apelesi bababi alonda baka bambu nkolongu Daudi, bunkwelisa Solomoni mu falasi jaka bambu nkolongu Daudi, nukunhindaki mbaka ku pandu papatimbilikana masi ku Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Ndienu nngolu Sadoki jajukua linyelu lelibii na mahuta kuhuma mu Lihema la Sapi nukunzakanii mahuta Solomoni ili jubiya bambu nkolongu. Ndipala bajemba imbata, na bandu boti bapwaga, “Jutama masoba gingi bambu nkolongu Solomoni!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Ndienu bandu boti bakwela bumpwata koni ajemba pelemba nukutogule ngamaa, mbaka nndema watenda kubagaja kwa sauti jabu.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Henu Adoniya pamu na ageni baki bajabii nabu bijijowana sauti heji pababiya ajomule matola gabu. Ebajowana sauti ji imbata, Yoabu jwalalukia, “Keleli yoti ayee yeijowaneka kumusi mana jaki kike?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Ejabiya jakona julongela, kumbi Yonasani mwana uku nngolu Abiasali jatenda kuhika. Ndienu Adoniya jwapwaga, “Jingala nkati, ndaba wehapa wa mundu waamboni na guleta majambu gaamboni.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Ndipala Yonasani anzibua Adoniya, “Ngahela ndaba bambu nkolongu Daudi anhimiki Solomoni kuba bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Najombi bambu nkolongu antuma pamu na nngolu Sadoki nu nndota Nasani na Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada na makundi mabeli ga alonda baka bambu nkolongu, bunkwelisi mu falasi jaka bambu nkolongu, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />nu nngolu Sadoki nu nndota Nasani bunzakani mahuta Solomoni pandu papatimbilikana masi ku Gihoni ili jubiya bambu nkolongu. Baboka pala koni atogule ndi ndaba gujowana sauti heji. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Sajenu Solomoni ndi bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Kabee akatumisi baka bambu nkolongu bahika kunhupa bambu witu Daudi koni apwaga, ‘Sapanga waku jwilihenga lihina laka Solomoni kuba likolongu kupeta lihina laku, na kabee jwikikwea kiteu su ulongosi kupeta kiteu saku.’ Najombi bambu nkolongu Daudi jajinama nukulumbali pikitanda saki, <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />nu kuloba koni jupwaga, ‘Julumbalika Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, joanhengiki mwana wangu jwikibeleku sangu kuba bambu nkolongu badala jangu, na jojunhengiki ndama mbaka nagabona aga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Ndienu ageni boti baka Adoniya babiya nulujogopu ngani, na batenda kupesangana. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Najombi Adoniya kwa ndaba anzogopa Solomoni, jwatilila ku Lihema laka Bambu Sapanga jakakamula kona ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku ili juwesa kulama. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni bumpwagila kubanga Adoniya jutili ku lihema la Sapi na jukamwi mu manyelu ja mesa ja malibu ju kupiiki matambiku koni jupwaga, “Ngamoki pani mbaka bambu Solomoni pajwinapila kubanga ngajaapwagi bandu angoma.”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Bambu Solomoni jwapwaga, “Ananumbweni kuba jwanga na makosa, ngajipati mang'aliku gokape. Lakini ananumbweni kubanga jubii ni kihakau, kupalika jwiikuwa.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalagalakia bukunkema Adoniya kuhuma mu Lihema la Sapi jujenda kwaki. Adoniya jwahika palongi jaka bambu nkolongu, jwajinama kwi isima. Bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Gujenda kunyumba jaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ampekee Solomoni malobi ga mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Daudi pajabiya pambipi na kuwa, ankema mwanamundu Solomoni, andagalakia malobi kupwaga, <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Mwana wangu ngati ekuyobaliki ihumbi yoti itenda kuwa, masoba gangu gajomwike. Gubiya nganganganga na weguwesa. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Guhenga malagalaki gala goti gaguge Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, gajugulagalaki guhenga, wagajetakiya malagalaki gaki goti ni mihilu jaki joti ngati ejuandiki mu kitabu Musa ili majambu gugujendila sapi nukuwesa mu kila lihengu leguhenga na kokapi kowijenda, <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />ili Bambu Sapanga juwesa kutimisa lilagi laki lejambwagila kubanga, ana bandu bi kibeleku sangu bagajetakia malagalaki gaki nukuntumaki sanga kuhenga ubaja kwa mwoju wabu woti, ngajwikosikani mundu kati jabu kwaalongosa bandu buku Izilaeli mu ipindi yote.<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Kupeta haga, wehapa gumanyiki gajandendila Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, namuna ejwaatendila akaakolongu ba alonda abeli buku Izalaeli, Abineli mwana uka Neli na Amasa mwana waka Yesili. Jwaakoma kipindi bandu atama sulukwali, ili kulepesa kisasi kwa ndaba ja majambu gagapiti kipindi sa ngondu. Jwaakoma bandu banga na makosa, henu ng'alika kwa ndaba ja majambu gajahengiki. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Ndienu, henga sewikibona ndi sa sapi kuhenga lakini wanndekaa jusejika na kuwa su lukwali.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Lakini waatendila saamboni bana baka Balizilai mundu juku Gileadi, na waabeka abiya akula pamesa, ndaba banhengi gaamboni panuntila mmbeli waku Abisolomu.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Kabee, jubii Shimei mwana waka Gela wi likabila laka Benjamini kuhuma ku Bahulimu, jojuwe jwanapila mbamba nukundondo ngamaa panajenda ku Mahanaimu. Lakini pajahika kumbengana ku losi lwa Yoludani, nundapila ku lihina laka Bambu Sapanga numpwagila, ‘Nganugukomi sukutumi upanga.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Lakini wehapa wandeka sanga kumpekee azabu. Wehapa gubii na malangu na wiimanya sewanhengila, nkoma hata jukubi nseja.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Daudi jwatenda kuwa na buntaga ku musi gobugukema musi waka Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Jalongusa nndema uku Izilaeli kwa yaka alubaini. Yaka saba jalongusa pajabii kumusi uku Hebuloni na yaka selasini ni mitatu jalongusa pajabii ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Ndienu, Solomoni jwatamila kiteu su ubambu badala ja atati baki Daudi nu ubambu ukolongu waki wabiya na makili.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Mwenikatai, Adoniya mwana waka Hagiti, jwajenda kuka Batisheba, babube ndi amabu baka Solomoni. Batisheba andalukia, “Boo, guhikiki sulukwale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Adoniya jwajibua, “Henaa, nhikiki su lukwali, <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />lakini, mi ni lijambu limu pena lukugupwagila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Batisheba apwagila, “Gupwaga pena.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya ampwagila, “Gumanyiki kubanga nepani nakabiya mi bambu nkolongu, hata bandu buku Izilaeli boti bahobalia nguba bambu nkolongu. Lakini, majambu gatenda kung'anambuka nu nndongu wangu jwabiya bambu nkolongu kulengana na ejapala Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Henu mi ni lilobi limwa pena noba wiinganila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Batisheba ampwagila, “Pwaga pena.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Najombi jwapwaga, “Gupepa koku nuguloba gunndoba bambu nkolongu Solomoni juneka nuntola Abishagi mmbomba juku Shunami, ili jubiya nhwanu wangu kwa ndaba manyiki ngajwagukani wehapa.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Batisheba ampwagila, “Hena, niilongila na bambu nkolongu kwa ndaba jaku.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Ndienu, Batisheba jwajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni ili kulonge naku kwa ndaba jaka Adoniya. Bambu nkolongu jwajumuka nukujenda kwapengana amabaki, jwaajinamia nu kutama pikiteu saki su ulongosi. Jwalagalakia aleta kiteu sengi su ubambu kwa ndaba jukutami amabaki na bombi batama upandi ukumalele waka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Batisheba jwapwaga, “Mii nililobi lisokopi gupepa koku gulijetakia nuguloba wiinganila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Bambu nkolongu apwagila, “Gulongilaje lilobi lako anyongo bangu, ndaba nganukanile.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Nabombi amabu baki bapwaga, “Gundeka nndogu waku Adoniya antola Abishagi, mmbomba juku Shunami hojo.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwaalalukia amabaki, “Ndaba ja kike gupala numpekia Abishagi? Hoku mbona kulengana pena nukuloba ubambu ukolongu wango! Kupeta hagaa jwombi ndi mmbeli wangu, na gukombuka kubanga nngolu Abiatali nu nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu Yoabu mwana waka Seluya abii upandi wake!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Pala ndi bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalapa kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga, kupwaga, “Sapanga jungomila kutali ana Adoniya ngajwiikuwi kwa ndaba jukuloba lilobi ale! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Henu, kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomii, jojumei nukuhenga miya na makili mu ubambu ukolongu gwa atati bangu Daudi na jojatimisa malagi gaki jwambekia ubambu ukolongu nepani na bandu bikibeleku sangu, napa kubanga lelenu Adoniya kupalika jukuwa!”<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Ndipala bambu nkolongu Solomoni andagalakia Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada najombi jwajenda kuka Adoniya nunkukoma.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoabu atenda kunkoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni ampwagila nngolu Abiatali, “Guboka gujenda ku nngonda waku ku Anatoti, wehapa gupalika guwaa! Lakini sajenu, nganugukomi kwa ndaba watotwi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga pawabii na atati bangu Adaudi, wang'alika pamu na bombi.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni ambenga Abiatali jwiikuba nngolu uka Bambu Sapanga, nukutimisa lilobi lejapwaga Bambu Sapanga ku Shilu, lelalongalia nyumba jaka Eli ni kibeleku saki.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu ejapata majambu haga jwatilila ku Lihema laka Bambu Sapanga nu kukamulaki nkona ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku, kwa ndaba jajongini na Adoniya lakini ngaseampwatiki Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni ejajowana kubanga Yoabu jubii mu Lihema laka Bambu Sapanga na jukamulaki nkona ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku, antuma Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada, nukumpwagi, “Jenda ukunkoma.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Ndipala Benaya jwajingala mu Lihema laka Bambu Sapanga, apwagila Yoabu, “Bambu nkolongu julagalaki gupita kunza.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Yoabu jwajibua, “Nepani ngamoke, isinguwa pambane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya jwakelabuka nukundandi bambu nkolongu gajapwaga Yoabu.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Solomoni japwaaga, “Henga ngati ejupwagiki, gunkoma nukuntaga ili jumokia nepani na nyumba jangu mahakau ga mwai gwanga na makosa sukwakoma bandu banga na makosa. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Bambu Sapanga ampekia azabu Yoabu kwa ndaba jakakoma bandu sanga atati bangu kumanya majambu haga. Jwaatukalia bandu abeli nakwakoma, sukutumi upanga, boti Abineli mwana waka Neli jojwabii kilongosi jwa akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli, na Amasa mwana uka Yeteli kilongosi wa akomana ngondu buku Yuda, bandu haba babiya bamboni na baajetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kupeta jwombi. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Makosa gukwakoma hoku gibiya panani jaka Yoabu ni kibeleku saki yaka yoti. Lakini kwaka Daudi ni ibeleku yaki, nyumba jaki ni kiteu saki su ubambu, kwiibiya nu lukwali yaka yoti.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Ndienu, Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, jwajenda ku Lihema, nukunkoma Yoabu nukuntaga ku nnyumba jakii, kunyumba jaki jejabii kulungwenza. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Bambu nkolongu ambeka Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada, kuba kilongosi jwa akomana ngondu badala jaka Yoabu, na ambeka Sodoki jwabiya nngolu badala jaka Abiatali.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu jwalagalakia bunkema Shimei, ampwagila, “Gulisengila nyumba mombo mu musi uku Yelusalemu, gutama pamba sanga kujenda pandu pangi pokapi. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Lisoba lewiboka nukuloboka kalosi ka Kidiloni, nukupwagi kyee wiitenda kuwa, kuwa kwaku kwiibiya sukupala wamweti.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei jwajibua, “Sapi bambu nkolongu wangu. Ngiti nhenga ngati egupwaga.” Ntumisi waku jiihenga ngati wa bambu wangu nkolongu egupwagiki, jombi jwatama ku musi uku Yelusalemu kipindi kilasu.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Lakini eyapeta yaka itatu, atumwa abeli baka Shimei batenda kutila, bajenda kuka Akishi mwana waka Maaka, bambu nkolongu juku Gati. Hejwamanyaa kubanga abii ku musi uku Gati, <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Shimei jwakwela piliponda laki, jwajenda hoku ili kwaataputa, kuka bambu nkolongu Akishi. Ndipala jwahika nukwabona jwaakelabua kunyumba. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni hebumpwagila kubanga Shimei juboi mu musi uku Yelusalemu nu kujenda ku musi uku Gati, nu kukelabuka, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />ankema Shimei nu kundalukia, “Boo, ngasenugulapisi kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga kubanga ngawiboki kumusi uku Yelusalemu, ngase nugupwagi kubanga, sakaka wiitenda kuwa lisoba lewiboka kujenda pokape? Nawe watenda kujetake, wambwagila, ‘Niihenga ngati egupwagiki wa bambu nkolongu wangu.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Mbona henu ngasegukamwi segunndapila Bambu Sapanga na ngase gupwatiki malagalaki ganugupekyaje?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Bambu nkolongu jwaendalia kumpwagi Shimei, “Wamweti ugamanyiki mabaja gagugahenga kwa atati bangu Daudi ndi kwa ndaba ja haga, Bambu Sapanga jwagupekia wehapa azabu. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Lakini bambu nkolongu Solomoni isijutenda kumbenge, ni kiteu su ubambu siihendalia kuba na makili palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga yaka yoti.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ndipala, bambu nkolongu anndagalakia Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, najombi jwajenda kundimanga nukunkoma Shimei. Ndienu ubambu ukolongu wabiya na makili ngani mu ulongosi uka Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni juloba umanyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2Majambu gi Ipindi 1:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Solomoni jwajongana na bambu nkolongu Falau bambu nkolongu juku Misili, sukunzukuu kamwali waki. Anndeta kamwali waka Falau nu kumbeka mu musi uka Daudi, mbaka pajwajomula kusenga nyumba ji kibambu na Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga pamu nu lumatu kuyongalota musi uku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1KI 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Kabula jaki, bandu abiya apiya matambiku gukutii ku itombi kwa ndaba nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga jabii ngase asengiki. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomoni ampai Bambu Sapanga, nukulongosa ngati ealongusa atati baki a Daudi, ila pe najwombi jwapalika kupia matambiku gukutini nukupogale ubani ku itombi.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Kipindi simu Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwajenda ku Gibeoni kupia matambiku, ndaba hoku ndi kwabii na pandu pukundumbali Sapanga. Solomoni jwayobali kupia maelupu ga matambiku gukutinii pandu pukupiiki matambiku pala. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Ku Gibeoni hoku Bambu Sapanga ampitila Solomoni mu ndotu ikilu, ampwagila ana, “Guloba sokapi nanepani isindenda kugupekea.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Solomoni ampwagila, “Gunhengi ntumisi aku Daudi upali anga kujomoka, kwa ndaba jabii jojuhobaleka kaku na jojujetakeka palongi jaku na jojubii na mwoju wamboni. Nanagu kumpeke upali hogu sukumpekee mwana waki sukutama pi kiteu saki su ubambu ngati ekubii lelenu. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Henu, Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, gumekiki nepani ntumisi waku kuba bambu nkolongu badala ja atati bangu Daudi. Lakini nepani nakoli na mwana pena na ngasemanyiki namuna jukulongosa. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Gumei pamba pikilanda ja bandu baku bawahagwi, na bombi abii bingi hata ngaseawesa kubalangika. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Ndienu nuguloba gumbekia mwoju gukujowana ili kwaatemu bandu baku, nhwesa kumanya gaamboni na mabaja, kwa ndaba ndi nyane jojiwesa kwaatemu bandu baku baabii bingi anana?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Kuloba kwaka Solomoni hoku kunndenganinya Bambu Sapanga, <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />najwombi ampwagila, “Kwa ndaba gunobiki sindu hesi, na ngasegulobiki kutama kipindi kilasu au mali na wala ngasegulobiki akabaja baku akuwaji, ila kulobiki pe kumanya namuna jukulongosa bandu kwa saamboni, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />ndienu isinuguhengila ngati egulobiki. Henu, isinugupekia umanyi na malangu yeyuye kabula jaku ngajojuwaiki kuba mundu ngati wehapa, na wala ngajwipiti mundu jongi ngati wenga baada jaku. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Kabee nagupekia gangi gaguge ngasegunobiki. Naguhenga gubiya na mali gingi na kuba ni isima ngani kupeta bambu nkolongu jokapi mwiipindi yaku. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Nakabee anagupwatiki indela jangu na malagalaki gangu nu kukamu mihilu jangu ngati ebahenga atati baku Daudi, ndienu, naguhenga gutama kipindi kilasu.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Solomoni pajwajumuka, jwamanya kubanga heji jabiya ndotu. Ndienu jwabuja ku Yelusalemu, jwajema palongi ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga nukumpiiki matambiku gukutinii na gu lukwali. Henu jwaahengila matola akatumisi baki boti.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni jutemu su umanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Lisoba limwa, akambomba abeli aselati, bajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Jumwa wabu jwapwaaga, “Wa bambu wangu nepani nu mbomba hajo tutamani nyumba jimwa, nepani nabelika mwana kipindi nzaa ajo jubii nnyumba. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Egapeta masoba ga tatu najombi jabelika mwana. Ngasejwabii mundu jongi nnyumba ila pee twepani twaabeli. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Ikilu jimu mwana waki jwatenda kuwa kwa ndaba jwatei kungonalela. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Hejabona hela jajumuka pamahiku ngani, nu kunzukuu mwana wane kipindi nepani panabiya ng'osili, nukungoneka puluteta jaki. Kabee anzukua mwana waki jojuwii, nukungoneka puluteta jangu nepani. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Enajumuka pulukela ili nunzongisa mwana wangu, numbona mwana juwii. Enundingalia ngani namanya kubanga jola nga mwana wango jonumbeliki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Lakini mbomba jongi jola jwapwaaga, “Ngahela! Mwanawangu ndi jojubii mwomi na waku wehapa ndi jojuwii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Najombi mbomba jojatumbuliya jola jwapwaga, “Ngahela ndeka! Mwana waku ndi jojuwii, na jwanepani jojubii mwomi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Ndienu baendalia kubisana ahelahe palongi jaka bambu nkolongu.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Ndipala bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwapwaga, “Kila jumu winu julaja kubanga, mwana waki ndi jojubii mwomi na jojuwii nga jwaki.” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu jwalagalakia kupwaaga, “Netila upanga!” Bundetila upanga bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Bambu nkolongu jwapwaaga. “Gunsekula mwana jojubii mwomi ipandi ibeli, na gumpekia nusu ajo na nusu jongi.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mbomba jojwabii amabu ba sakaka bakamwana jojwabii mwomi jola ambonila ikia mwanamundu ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Gupepa koku bambu nkolongu, wankoma mwana. Gumpekia pe nzaa hoju mwanahoju jojubii mwomi, anzukua jwombi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Lakini mbomba jongi jola jwapwaga, “Ngahela mwana hoju jwiikuba jwanepani wala jwaki gunsekula ipandi ibeli.”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni japwaaga, “Wankoma mwana! Gumpekia mbomba jukutumbuli hoju anzukua, ndaba sakaka jwombi ndi amaki baki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Bandu boti Aizilaeli ebajowana namuna ejatemula bambu nkolongu Solomoni, batenda kunzogopa ndaba bamanyiki kubanga jabii nu umanyi waka Bambu Sapanga gogunnzangatiya kutemu kwaamboni.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Akakilongosi babunnzangati Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Ndienu, Solomoni jabiya julongosa nndema woti uku Izilaeli, <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />na akakilongosi bababi pai jaki babiya, Azalia mwana uka Sadoki, jwabiya nngolu, <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Eliholefu na Ahiya babiya bana baka Shisha, babiya akakatibu, Yehoshafati mwana waka Ahiludi, jwabiya jojutunza ngombuke ja majambu ndalindali. <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwana uka Yehoyada, jabiya nkolongu jwa alonda, Sadoki pamu na Abiatali, babiya akagolu. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azalia mwana uka Natani jwabiya kilongosu, nngolu Zabudi mwana Natani na jwabia kabee joampeke mawasu mbambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishali jwabiya jojujemale nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu na Adonilamu mwana uka Abuda, jwabiya jojujemale lihengu langa na malepu.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Solomoni jwaahagwi akakolongu bukujemale wilaya komi ni ibeli mu nndema woti uku Izilaeli. Haba jaapekia kuhenga lihengu lukukusanya posu nukupeleka posu kwa ndaba jaka bambu nkolongu na nyumba jaki, kila jumwa wabu jwaleta posu kuhuma ku nkoa waki kwa mwei gumu kila saka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Ganga ndi mahina ga akakilongosi haba. Beni Huli jajemalia pandu pi itombi yuku Efulaimu, <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Beni Dekeli jwajemalia misi juku Makai na Shalibimu na Beti Shemesi na Eloni Beti Hanani. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Beni Hesedi jwajemalia musi uku Aluboti, na jwajemalia kabee musi wa Soko pandu poti uku Hefeli. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Beni Abinadabu nndomi uka Tafati jojabia kamwali waka Solomoni, jwajemalia musi wa Nafati Doli. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana mwana uka Ahiludi, jwajemalia misi juku Taanaki, na Megido na pandu poti pa Beti Sheani papabi pambipi na musi uku Zaleti, upandi ukusini wa musi uku Yezileeli, nu kuhuma ku Beti Sheani mbaka kumisi ja Abeli Mahola na kumusi uku Yokimeamu. <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Beni Gebeli, jwajemalia musi uku Lamoti Gileadi pamu ni ijiji yaki yeibii pai ja Yaili. Manase jwajemalia nkoa uku Aligobu gowabii lieneu luku Bashani na misi joti mikolongu jabiya sitini jejabiya asengiki lumatu kujiyongalota nukubeka makomeu ga shaba mu milyangu jaki. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwana waka Ido, jwajemalia musi uku Mahanaimu. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaasi, nndomi uka Basemati, kamwali waka Solomoni, jwajemalia musi uku Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana mwana uka Hushai, jwajemalia musi uku Asheli na musi uku Bealoti. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafati mwana uka Palua, jwajemalia musi uku Isakali. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei, mwana uka Ela, jwajemalia musi uku Benjamini <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Gebeli mwana uka Uli, jwajemalia musi uku Gileadi, nndema goguwe pa mwandi jwabiya julongosi bambu Sihoni juku Aamoli, na bambu nkolongu Ogu juku Bashani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 4:19">Kulekana na akikilongosi komi na abeli haba kwabiya nu nkolongu jumwa jojajemalia nndema woti uku Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulongosi waka Solomoni gutenda kuneng'ane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Bandu buku Yuda na Izilaeli babii bingi banga kuwesa kubalangika, bombi abiya posu jingi nabombi abiya akula nakunywa nukutogule. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Solomoni jwalongusa pandu pa akabambu akolongu boti kutumbuli ku losi luku Efulati mbaka ku nndema wa Apilisiti, mbaka mu mpanga guku nndema uku Misili. Bandu banga Ayaudi buntumakia nukulepa kodi kwaki kipindi soti sukutama kwaki.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Posu jejabiya jiitumika mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni na atumisi baki jikubika jingi ku lisoba limu, ndi wabiya uwembi gogulembuliki madebi mia itatu na sitini, nu uwembi goguyobaliki madebi mia saba na ishilini, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />ng'ombi yeikendiki yabiya komi, na ng'ombi yu mulikundi yabiya ishilini, na makondoo mia jimu pamu ni kinyama sebikikema kulungu, na holoku ni imbui yumukinyoi ni ingoku ikolongu.<verse eid="1KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalongusa nndema woti, kutumbuli upandi golijingi lyoba wa losi lwa Efulati, kuboke ku Tifisa mbaka ku musi uku Gaza, wabiya mu ulongosi waki na kwabiya nu lukwali ni milema joti jejabii pambipi naku.<verse eid="1KI 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Masoba goti gu ulongosi waka Solomoni, bandu buku Yuda na bandu buku Izilaeli, kutumbuli ku Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba batama sulukwali, kila mundu jabiya juwesa kuhenga lihengu mu migonda jaki ji mizabibu ni mitini jaki. <verse eid="1KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomoni jwabii ni indamba elupu alubaini ya falasi yeihuta magali ga ngondu na akaalonda baakwela falasi elupu komi na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Bandu baajemale komi na abeli bala, kila jumu kwa mwei waki goampangi, bakusanya posu na baapelika posu jejitosa kwa ndaba jaka bambu nkolongu na kwa ndaba ja bandu boti bahika kula kwaki. Bapelika kila sindu sesapalika kibiya ngati ebalagalakiya. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Kila mundu pajahika zamu jaki, jwapelika inganu na manyoi gukulea falasi yaki ni inyama yengi.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Sapanga ampekia Solomoni umanyi na malangu ngani, kumanya kwaki kwabii kwanga ni kipemu. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Umanyi waka Solomoni wapeta umanyi wa bandu baatamika upandi wa kolipitii lyoba na bandu buku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Jwabiya nu umanyi kupeta bandu bowa kumpeta Etani mundu juku Ezilai, na jabiya nu umanyi kumpeta Hemani nu kumpeta Kalikoli nu kumpeta Dalida mwana waka Maholi nu kujowaneka kwaki kwaenia milema japambipi. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Najombi jatonga mesali elupu itatu ni mihambu elupu jimu nu nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Jwalongila majambu gi mikongu, kutumbuli mikongu ji mielezi gogubii ku Lebanoni, hata mmea gobugukema hisopo gogumela mu lumatu. Jwalongila kabee juu jiinyama ni ijuni, na hindu yeikwaba na homba ni inyama yeibii na mwai goguhimi na yeitagi mahombi. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Bandu kuhuma mu milema joti, na akabambu akolongu boti bababiya ahika kujowane majambu gu umanyi, bahika kunzowanake.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuandaa kusenga Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2Majambu gi Ipindi 2:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Najombi Hilamu bambu nkolongu juku Tilu, jojwabii nkosi uka Daudi, ejamanya kubanga Solomoni ndi bambu nkolongu badala ja atati baki, jwaatuma akatumisi baki kwaki. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Najombi Solomoni annzibua bambu nkolongu Hilamu kwa malobi ganga, <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Gumanyiki kubanga atati bangu Daudi ngasebawesiki kunsengee Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki, nyumba jukundumbali, kwa ndaba ja ngondu jingi jejakomana na akabaja bu nndema wapambipi mbaka Bambu Sapanga pajunhenga jwaawesa. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Lakini sajenu, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, junhengiki ndama sulukwali pandu poti. Ngasemi na akabaja wala ngasembata mang'aliku. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Ndi hamwi kunsenge Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, nyumba jukundumbali. Ngati Bambu Sapanga ejaalagila atati bangu kupwaaga, ‘Mwana waku jonanhenga jutama pi kiteu saku su ulongosi ndi jojinzengila Nyumba jaka Sapanga!’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Ndienu walagalakia bandu baku annzekuliya mikongu ji mielezi juku Lebanoni. Bandu bangu bajiunga pamu na bandu baku mu lihengu heli, nanepani naalepa atumisi baku kulengana na ewipwaga, ndaba ngati egumanyiki, ngamundu jokapi kwitu jojumanyiki kuseku mikongu ngati mwanganya mwa Asidoni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hilamu jwatoguli ngamaa ejamanya majambu haga kuhuma kwaka Solomoni, japwaga, “Bambu Sapanga julumbalika kipindi senze, sukumpeke Daudi mwana jojubii nu umanyi ukulongusa nndema nkolongu gongo.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Ndienu, Hilamu jumpelakia Solomoni majambu, kupwaga, “Nagajopiki majambu gaku, na ngiti nugupekia mikongu joti ji mielezi ni mikongo ji miboleshi jewijipala. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Bandu bangu biikusanya mipendi nukugahele kuhuma ku Lebanoni mbaka kunhanga nkolongu nukugakonga mapungu mapungu gajebalaa panani ja masi mbaka pandu pawiimbwagila. Hoku nagabopula nawehapa wagajopa. Ku upandi waku wehapa wiimbekia posu kwa ndaba ja bandu bangu.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Ndipala, Hilamu ampekia Solomoni mipendi joti yi mikongu ji mielezi ni miboleshi jejapala, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />najombi Solomoni ampekia Hilamu inganu madebi laki ibeli na elupu alubaini na mahuta gaamboni madebi mia ibeli kila saka, kwa ndaba ja kwalea bandu bunyumba jaki.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga ampekia Solomoni umanyi ngati eandagila. Kwabiya nu lukwali kati jaka Solomoni na Hilamu na batenda kujetangane kati jabu.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jakusanya bandu elupu selasini kuhuma pandu poti pu nndema uku Izilaeli, na ahenga mahengu gukulamiswa, <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />ambeka Adonilamu jubiya jojujemale. Jwabagulana bandu haba makundi matatu, kila likundi bandu elupu komi, jagapelika makundi haga kwa zamu, mwei gumu ku Lebanoni na miei jibeli kunyumba. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomoni jwabii kabee na bandu baatoto misigu elupu sabini na baabasa malimu kwiitombi elupu semanini, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />pamu na akakilongosi elupu itatu na mia tatu bababiya ajemale lihengu heli nu kwaalongo baahenga lihengu boti. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Kwa malagalaki gaka bambu nkolongu bayembula malibu makolongu na gaamboni, ili kugabasa kwa ndaba jukusenge nsingi wa Nyumba jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Ndienu akapundi baka Solomoni na baka Hilamu na bandu ba musi uku Gebali baandiya malibu ni imbau yukusenge Nyumba jaka Sapanga heji.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni jusenga Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Eyapeta yaka mia nsesi na semanini toka Aizilaeli pababoka ku Misili, Solomoni jatumbulia kusenge Nyumba jaka Sapanga. Hesi sabiya saka su nnsesi su ulongosi waka Solomoni mu nndema uku Izilaeli na hogu wabiya mwei wa pili lihina lengi bugukema mwei wa Zifu. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Nyumba heji, jejuje bambu nkolongu Solomoni ansengila Bambu Sapanga jabiya nu ulasu wa meta ishilini na saba, nu upana wa meta tisa, nu ulasu kujenda kunani wabiya meta kumi na tatu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Sengu ja jumba heji jabia nu ulasu wa meta komi nu upana waki wabia meta nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Jijibekila Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga heji madilisha, kila lidilisha labiya lipana su nkati na sakunza labiya lipepandau. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Jwalenganakia yumba mulutengu kujiyongalota Nyumba joti jaka Bambu Sapanga, ili jikamulana na nyumba joti. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Yumba ya pai mu yumba yejabiya jujonzuki yela, yabiya nu upana wa meta ibeli na lobu, na yumba yuku nani yeyapwata sabiya nu upana wa meta ibeli na lobo tatu, na yumba yukunani ngani yabiya nu upana wa meta itatu. Yumba yukunani heyi yabiya ngaseilengine ipemu yaki yu upana, ndaba Solomoni jwabiya jupungisi kidogu lumatu lwa kunza kuyongalota nyumba, ili nguzo jiikamulana nu lumatu.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Kipindi pababia aendelee kusenga Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, ngasekwajowaniki sauti ja nyundu wala sindu sokapi sikisomasoma pababia atenda kusenga, ndaba basenga kwa malibu gaabasiki toka kobagajukua.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Ndyangu gu kujingalii nsumba sa pai wabiya upandi ukusini ja nyumba, nkati kwabiya na ngazi ili bandu awesa kukwele ku sumba sukunani na sumba sukunani ngani. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Ndienu, Solomoni jwasenga nyumba heji na jatenda kujomoka. Nhaga wa Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga heji babiya alenganake kwi imbau i mikongu ji mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwasenga yumba mulutengu ja Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga joti. Yumba heyi yabiya nu ulasu ukujenda kunani wa meta ibeli na lobu kila sumba sa pai na sapani na sa tatu nayombi yabiya ilombakini na nyumba kwa maboliti gi mikongu mielezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ndienu malobi gaka Bambu Sapanga gunhikila bambu nkolongu Solomoni kubanga, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Kwa majambu ga nyumba jenze jegusenga, ana gujetaki malagalaki gangu ni mihilu jangu nanepani ngiti nuguhengila majambu goti ganaalagila atati baku Adaudi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Nepani niitamaa pikilanda ja mwa bandu buku Izilaeli nkati ja Nyumba jegusenga na nganaaleki hata kulenga.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Ndipala Solomoni jwijisenga Nyumba jaka Sapanga nukujijomule.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapambu gu nkati ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:8-14">2Majambu gi Ipindi 3:8-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Upandi gu nkati ulumatu lwa nyumba heji juguyekalia kwi imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi, kuhumi pai mbaka mu lupendi lu munhaga, na pai japatandiki imbau yi mikongu ji mibeloshi. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Sumba su nkati, sebikikema Pandu pa Sapi Ngani, sabia bikisengiki pandu punnyuma ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga. Babiya bikisengiki sukutumii imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi kutumbuli pai mbaka kwi ligolu, nu ulasu waki sabiya meta tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Sumba sesabii palongi ja Pandu pa Sapi Ngani, jabiya nu ulasu wa meta komi na nani. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Imbau yi mikongu mielezi yeyabiya iyekali lumatu lwa nyumba sunkati yabiya biipambiki sukusola maua gagalengana na mongu na maua gagajanduli. Kila pandu pabiya payekaliwi kwi imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi, wala nga lilibu lokapi lelabonikana.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Pandu pu nkati ngani ja Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga heji, Solomoni jwalenganaki sumba sapakazika papuje ndi Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga pa bilibeka. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Sumba hesi ndi sabiya nu ulasu wa meta tisa nu upana wa meta tisa nu ulasu waki kujenda kunani meta tisa, nasombi bikipambiki kwa zahabu ja sapi. Kabee jalenganaki pandu pukupiiki matambiku kwi imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Solomoni jupakilama kwa madini ga zahabu ja sapi pandu pu nkati ja nyumba, na palongi ja sumba su nkati jwalenganakia mikupu nu jwijihatambula mikupu ja madini ga zahabu heji kuhumi upandi gongo mbaka upandi wa pili wa sumba su nkati hesi, sesabiya apambiki sukutumii madini ga zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Nyumba joti su nkati jijikilimi kwa zahabu, kabee jakilima mesa joti jukupiiki matambiku papabi mu sumba su nkati ngani jakilima kwa madini ga zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Jwalenganikia sukutumi imbau yunkongu gu nzeituni imong'umong'u yi iumbi ibeli yeibii na mapapati, kila kimong'ung'u sabiya nu ulasu ukujenda kunani meta nsesi na nusu, jwiibeka mu sumba su nkati ngani. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kila lipapati labiya nu ulasu wa meta ibeli na nusu, ndienu ulasu kuhuma mu lipapati limu mbaka mu lipapati langi wabiya meta nhwanu, <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Kiumbi sengi mapapati gaki gabiya nu ulasu wa meta nhwanu, iumbi yoti ibeli yabiya ni ipemu yelaye ni liumbu lelale. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Ulasu wi kiumbi jumu wabiya meta nhwanu, nu ulasu ukiumbi sengi sela wabiya agolago. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Imong'umong'u heyi yabiya ilengini, mapapati gaki gagahatambwiki. Lipapati likimong'umong'u simu lagusa lumatu lumu ni lipapati lengi lagusa lumatu lwa pili, koni gangi gagusini pikilanda ja sumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Imong'umong'u heyi jwakilama kwa madini ga zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Lumatu lwa kunza nu nkati kila sumba julupambiki sukusola iumbi yeibii na mapapati, mikongu mitendi na maua gagajanduli. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Kabee pai ja yumba ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga yunkati na ya kunza jakilimi kwa madini ga zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Sukujingii mu sumba su nkati jalenganaki milyangu sukutumi imbau yu nkongu gu nzeituni. Kujingi mu sumba su nkati ngani pelemu ju ndyangu yalenganakiya liumbu la kona nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Mu milyangu mibeli ji mikongu ji mizeituni, jwiisola iyumbi yeibi na mapapati ni mitendi na maua gagajanduli, jwijikilima imbau heji ni misolu heji sukutumii zahabu ja sapi. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Ndienu jwalenganakia kabee pelemu gogubi na kona nsesi gukujingalia pa sengu. Pelemu ju ndyangu hogu jalenganakiya ku mikongu ji mizeituni. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Kwabiya ni milyangu jibeli jejawesa kutulika jejabia alenganaki sukutumii imbau yunkongu gu mibeloshi, na kila gumu gwabiya na bawaba yeyawesa kuguhenga guhogoka kila kipandi panani ja sengi. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Panani ji milyangu heji, basola nsolu wi iumbi yeibii na mapapati ni mitendi na maua gagajanduli, jwijipamba sapi misolu heji sukutumii zahabu ja sapi.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Jwasenga ukumbi unkati goguwe lumatu lwaki lwabiya na safu itatu ya malibu gaabasiki na limwa la boliti yu nkongu mwelezi yealembiki sapi.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Nsingi wa nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga Solomoni jasenga mu saka su nsesi mu ulongosi waki mwei gu nhwanu gobugukema mwei wa zifu. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga jajomuka kusenga mwei wa nani liina lengi agukema buli mu saka sa komi na moja ukulongosa ejalagalakiya bambu nkolongu Solomoni. Ndienu Solomoni jatumia yaka saba kusenga nu kujomule Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Nyumba jaka bambu Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomoni julisengila nyumba jaki, na batumia yaka komi na tatu mbaka kujomoka. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Ndienu jwasenga nyumba jejijikema Kitengu suku Lebanoni. Ulasu waki wabiya meta alubaini nu nsesi na nusu, nu upana waki wabiya meta ishilini na mbili na lobu, nu ulasu waki gukujenda kunani wabiya meta komi na tatu na nusu. Jabii ni misitali nnsesi yi mikongu ji mielezi, mipengu jejakamulakia maboliti gi mikongu ji mielezi ku upandi uku nani. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Kila safu jabiya ni mipengu komi nu nhwanu, ndienu mipengu joti pamu jabiya alubaini nu nhwanu. Yumba yejasengiki kunani ji ligolu, jakomangaliya mipengu ji mikongu mielezi mipendi kumi nu nhwanu kwa kila safu jimu. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Kwabiya na safu itatu ya mandilisa gagabia galingalani. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Milyangu joti jabiya ja kona nsesi na pelemu ya mandilisa yabiya ni ipemu yeilengana pandi yoti.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Jwasenga sengu sukutumi mipengu, jejuje ulasu waki wabiya meta ishilini na mbili na lobu nu upana waki wabiya meta komi na tatu na nusu. Palongi ja nyumba heji pabii na sengu. Palongi ja sengu kwabii ni mipendi na palongi ji mipengu papitila kapagaa kasoku.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Solomoni jwasenga sengu ji Kiteu su ulongosi momuje ndi jwabia jutemuli magambu ga bandu. Heji ndi bijikema Sengu ju Kutemulila. Jabiya bijipambiki kwi imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi kutumbuli pai mbaka kunani kukipagaa.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Nyumba jaki jukutama mweni jabii kunyuma ja Sengu ju Kutemulila, jabiya jisengiki ngati yengi yela. Kabee Solomoni jasenga nyumba ngati sengu kwa ndaba jaka kamwali waka Falau, jojuwe jwabia annzukwi.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Nyumba heyi yoti yabiya isengikwi kwa malibu ga bei ngolongu tumbuka pai mbaka kunani, malibu gehaga gabiya bagabasiki kwi ipemu yeipalika, nukusekuliwa kwa pukuswanzi upandi wa kunza nu nkati. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Misingi ja nyumba heyi jabiya bijisengiki kwa malibu ga bei ngolongu na makolongu gagabi nu ulasu wa meta itatu na nusu nu upana wa meta nsesi na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Pandu pupanani basengiki sukutumi malibu ga sapi ngani gabugabasiki kwi ipemu yeipalika, na kwi imbau yi mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Sengu ju nkati ja nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu jela jabiya na safu itatu ja malibu gabugabasiki na lumatu lwi imbau yi mikongu ji mielezi, ngati ejabii sengu ju nkati ja nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gaka Hilamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:13-14">2Majambu gi Ipindi 2:13-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Solomoni jaatuma bandu ku Tilu kunkema Hilamu, jojuwe jabiya pundi jukulenganake hindu ya madini ga shaba. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Hilamu hoju jwabiya mwana waka mmbomba joawii alomi baki kuhuma ku likabila la Dani na atati baka Hilamu babiya bukuhumi ku Tilu, kabee babiya baaponda hindu ya shaba. Hilamu jabiya jubiii nu umanyi ngani pamu na malangu nu upundi, jojuwesa ngani kuponda hindu yokapi ya shaba. Ndienu jwahika kuka bambu nkolongu Solomoni, nu kunhenge mahengu gaki goti.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mipengu mibeli ja shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2Majambu gi Ipindi 3:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hilamu jalenganakia mipengu jibeli ja shaba, kila lupendi lumwa lwabiya nu ulasu wa meta tisa nu uneni waki wabiya meta sita. Nkati labiya lihotu lelule uneni wa pandi yaki wabiya sentimita ibeli. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Jalenganakia kabee mataji mabeli ga shaba sukuhugati ili kugabeka panani ji mipengu heji, kila litaji labiya nu ulasu wa meta ibeli na lobu kujenda kunani. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Ndienu jalenganakiya wapu gu mikupu jibeli jejilengini, joti heji jabiya kwa ndaba jukupambi mataji ga shaba gabagabei mu mipengu jela. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Kabee jalenganakia safu ibeli ya hindu yeilengana na makomamanga sukutumii shaba, nukugapanga safu ibeli kuyongalota mataji gala panani ja kila mpengu.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Mataji haga gabiya panani ji mipengu palongi ja sengu, bijipambiki maua ga gagalengana na maua ga mapesuka, ulasu waki kujenda kunani wabiya meta ibeli. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Mataji haga gabii panani ji mipengu jibeli heji, na kabee gabiya panani ja pandu papabii ni liumbu ngati la bakuli pambipi na wapu gola. Kabee kwabii na maumbu mia mbili gagalengana na makomamanga mu safu ibeli kuyongalota kila kimutu simu su mpengu.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hilamu jajemika mpengu pa sengu ja Nyumba jaka Sapanga. Mpengu gu upandi uku kasikazini jugukema liina Yakini, nu mpengu gojwajemika upandi ukusini jugukema Boazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Mataji gagabii panani jaki gabiya na maumbu ga maua gagalengini na maua ga mapesuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:22">Enu lihengu lukulenganake mipengu gatenda kujomoka.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndundu wa shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2Majambu gi Ipindi 4:2-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Hilamu jalenganakia nndundu nkolongu wa Shaba. Wabiya gunnyongulate upana waki ndi wabiya meta nsesi na nusu kuhumi ako mbaka ako, nu ulasu waki meta ibeli na lobu nu uyongulate waki wabiya meta komi na tatu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Pai junkenga waki, kuyongalota nndundu hogu wabiya na safu ibeli yi itamiku yealenganaki sukuponda yeilengini ni ikoi, ikoi komi kila meta jimu. Itamiku yi ikoi heyi yabiya ilenganakiwi kipindi aselase sebalenganakia nndundu hogu. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Nndundu hogu bugubeka panani ji imong'u mong'u ya mapongu ga ng'ombi komi na mabeli, imong'u mong'u itatu yalingalia upandi uku kasikazini ni itatu upandi golijingi lyoba ni itatu upandi ukusini ni itatu upandi golipita lyoba. Nndundu hogu bugubeka panani ji imong'u mong'u ya mapongu ga ng'ombi heyi nu upandi waki uku nyuma watenda kulingalani. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Unene undundu hogu wabiya sentimita saba na nusu. Nkenge waki walengana nu nnkenga ukikombi, na walengana ni liua lelilengana na maua ga mapesuka gagajanduli. Nndundu hogu guwesa kutwele masi lita elupu alubaini.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itamiku ya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Hilamu kabee jwalenganakia itamiku komi ya shaba, kila kitami sabiya nu ulasu wa meta jimu na lobo tatu nu upana wa meta jimu na lobo tatu nu ulasu waki kujenda kunani wabiya meta jimu na lobu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Ndi itamiku heyi jwalenganakia ana, kwabiya na mabamba gikisomasoma gagabiya gakamulaki mu mitalimbu. Panani ja mabamba haga gagakamulakiwi ni mitalimbu, <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Panani ja mabamba haga kwabiya ni imong'umong'u ya mahimba naya mapongu ga ng'ombi ni iumbi yeibii na mapapati. Imong'umong'u heyi yabiya iyekaliwi na biibei mapambu gaalokiki sapi. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Kila kitamiku sabiya na mataili nsesi ga shaba ni isoma soma yukutonge mataili ga shaba. Munkona nsesi ju nndundu kwabiya ni ipungu ya shaba kwa ndaba ju nndundu hogu. Kila kipungu babeka mapambu ga maua gaalokiki. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Nkati ji kitamiku kwabiya na napwasi jejabiya juyongulake jejabii nu uneni wa nusu mita. Kuyongolota nndomu waki basoliki misolu ni itamiku heyi yabiya pandi yoti ilengini wala nga yunyongolake. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Mataili nsesi haga gabiya pai ja mabamba gala, isoma soma yipikilanda yukulongulake mataili yabiya iunganiki ni kitamiku seni, ulasu ukujenda kunani wa mataili haga ndi sentimeta sitini na sita. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Mataili haga galenganakiwa ngati mataili ga magali gukuhutwa na falasi, ni isomasoma yaki yukutonge mataili na malingi gaki ni sipoku yaki na belingi yaki, yoti yabiya yukuponda. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Pai ja kila kitamiku sabiya na hindu yukukamulaki nsesi mu kona yaki, nayombi yabiya ikamulakiwi ni kitamiku. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Na panani ja kila kitamiku kwabiya na sindu sekiyongalwiti upana waki wabiya sentimita ishilini na mbili, ikamulaki na mabamba gagabiya upandi wa panani gakamulana ni kitamiku seni. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Pandu papabii na napwasi mu ipungu na mu mabamba na kila mukitamiku, Hilamu jasola micholu ji iumbi yeibii na mapapati na gi lihimba na gi mikongu gi mitendi, jayongulakia na mataji ga mapambu. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Hela ndi Hilamu hejalenganakiya itamiku komi yukuhugati ku kutumii madini ga shaba, yoti yabiya ilengini kwi ipemu na maumbu.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Hilamu kabee jwalenganakia mindundu komi ja shaba, nndundu gumu kwa kila kitamiku. Kila nndundu wabiya nu upana wa meta jimwa na lobo tatu na lawesa kutoto masi lita mia nani na semanini. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Jabeka itamiku nhwanu upandi ukusini wa nyumba ni mindundu nhwanu upandi uku kasikazini, nu nndundu gola jugubeka mu kona ju upandi ukusini wa Nyumba jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu yu Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2Majambu gi Ipindi 4:11-5:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Hilamu jalenganakia kabee ibega na sepetu na nndundo. Ndienu Hilamu jajomula lihengu leandagalakia bambu nkolongu Solomoni juhenga hindu yu munyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Hilamu kabee jalenganakiya mipengu jibeli ni mindundu jibeli mataji gaabei panani ji mipengu mibeli na wapu ibeli kwa ndaba jukuyekale mataji mabeli haga, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />malenganu gi mikomamanga mia nsesi kwa ndaba ja wapu ibeli yela, safu ibeli ja makomamanga kwa kila wapu ili kupambi mataji gabeli gala gagabii panani ji mipengu. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Kabee jalenganakia itamiku komi, ni ikamulaki komi mu itamiku heyi, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />nu ndundu gumu gola ni imong'umong'u ya mapongu ga ng'ombi komi na mabeli, pai ju nndundu hogu. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Nakabee ibega na sepetu ni mindundu, yombu yoti heyi yabiya mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga yeyuye Hilamu jundenganakia bambu nkolongu Solomoni, yabiya ya shaba jejing'anyiki. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Hindu heyi yoti bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalagalakia ilenganakiwa sukuhugati ku Yoludani, pandu puluhombi lu kitopi ku Sukoti na Saletani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomoni ngasejwaipemiki ukolongu wa hindu heyi ndaba yabii hingi ngani, na kwa ndaba ukolongu wa shaba ngasewamanyikini.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Solomoni jwalenganakia hindu yoti yeyapalika mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga. Mesa ja zahabu jukupiiki matambiku madini ga zahabu mesa ja madini ga zahabu kwa ndaba ja mabumunda gukubeka palongi jaka Sapanga, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />hindu yukubeke taa yealenganaki kwa madini ga zahabu sapi yebabeka palongi ja sumba su nkati, nhwanu upandi ukusini nu nhwanu upandi uku kasikazini, na maua na taa na koleu, yoti yabiya ya zahabu, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />masinia ga zahabu ni mikasi jukusekuli mitambi ji mishumaa, na mabakuli ni imbani yukubekee ubani na mbundi yukujokule mwotu, yoti yabiya ya zahabu sapi, bawabu i milyangu ja pandu pu nkati ngani ja nyumba na bawabu i milyangu ja sengu jukuhenge ulumbi wi Nyumba jaka Sapanga yabiya ya zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwajomula lihengu loti yumu Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, ndi Solomoni jwaleta mali goti gaguge atati baki Adaudi babiya bagabei palongi jaka Sapanga, ndi yabiya madini ga feza na zahabu na yombu, jwiibeka mu kikoku sa Nyumba jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku li Lilaganu liletwa ku Nyumba jaka Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2Majambu gi Ipindi 5:2-6:2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwaakema palongi ku Yelusalemu akaseja na akakikolongosi boti ba makabila na akikilongosi bu lukolo lwa Aizilaeli ahika palongi jaki, ili kuliboa Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga mu musi uku Siyoni, goguwe ndi musi uka Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Kipindi sa matola ga mwei wa Etanimu, goguwe ndi mwei wa saba kulengana na eabalanga Aizilaeli, ndi bandu haba boti bahikaniya palongi jaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Kipindi akaseja boti buku Izilaeli pababiya ahikiki, akagolu batotula Lisanduku li Lilaganu, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Alawi na Agolu bilihamisa Lisanduku li Lilaganu ni Lihema la Sapi lu Kuketangane, na yombu yaki ya Sapi yoti yeyabi mu Lihema heli. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni na bandu boti Aizilaeli bahikaniya palongi ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu, nukupiya matambiku ga makondoo na ng'ombi yanga kubalangika. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Ndienu akagolu bilijingia Lisanduku li Lilaganu laka Bambu Sapanga pandu paki, mu sumba su nkati sa Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, Pandu pa Sapi Ngani, kui ja mapapati gi ihumbi yebiikema makelubi. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Ihumbi yeibii na mapapati yabiya ihatambwi mapapati gaki pandu paabekiki Lisanduku li Lilaganu, henu Lisanduku ni mikongu jaki jukutotulela jabiya jiyekaliwi na mapapati. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Mikongu heji jabii milasu ngani kona yaki yawesa kubonikana kuhuma pa sengu, lakini ngasejawesa kubonikana kuhuma upandi wa kunza. Mikongu heji jakona jibii pandu hapa mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Ngase sabii sindu nkati ji Lisanduku li Lilaganu ila pe ibau ibeli ya malibu yeyuye Musa jwiibeka homu ebabii kukitombi suku Holebu, pandu papupe Bambu Sapanga jwahenga lilaganu na bandu buku Izilaeli pabahuma ku nndema uku Misili.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Agolu pababoka Pandu pa Sapi Ngani, unang'anu watwelala mu Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Nabombi agolu basindwa kuhenga lihengu labu kwa ndaba jukung'anya kwaka Bambu Sapanga kwabia kutweli Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Ndienu Solomoni japwaaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">“Bambu Sapanga japwaga kubanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">jwiitama pandu papabii na lwii ndekindeki<verse eid="1KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Sakaka nugusengi Nyumba jukutama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:13">pandu pawitama masoba ganga na mwisu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobi gaka Solomoni kwa bandu Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2Majambu gi Ipindi 6:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Ndienu Solomoni jaang'anumbukia bandu boti buku Izilaeli ndi jatenda kwaapenge, <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />jaapwaga, “Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, ndaba kwa makili gaki jutimisi lilagi laki lejaalagila atati bangu Adaudi, koni jukapwaga, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Tumbuka panaaboa bandu bamba ku nndema uku Misili, ngasenanhagwi musi wokapi mu makabila ga Aizilaeli ili anzengila nyumba jukunumbalila, ila pe nuhagwi Daudi, jwaalongusa bandu bangu Aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Solomoni jwaendalia kupwaga, atati bangu bapala kunsenge nyumba ju kunndumbalia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Lakini Bambu Sapanga jaapwagila atati bangu Adaudi ana, Guwasali sapi mu mwoju waku kupala kunzenge nyumba. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Hata hela, ngawehapa wewinzengila nyumba, ila mwana waku jowampapa ndi jojwiinzengila nyumba heji.<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />Enu sajenu, Bambu Sapanga jutimisi lilagi laki, ndi sajenu mi bambu nkolongu badala pa atati bangu Adaudi, nukutami kiteu su ulongosi sa Izilaeli ngati Bambu Sapanga ejalagila, kabee nzengiki nyumba jukundumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Kabee napahengiki pandu pukubeka Lisanduku li Lilaganu lelule nkati jaki libii lilaganu lejwahenga Bambu Sapanga na akahoku bitu, kipindi pajwapia mu nndema uku Misili.<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloba kwaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2Majambu gi Ipindi 6:12-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Ndienu Solomoni jwajema palongi ja pandu pukupiiki matambiki paka Bambu Sapanga, koni bandu boti buku Izilaeli abii papu, jwatondabiya maboku gaki kunani, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />jwapwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa bandu Aizilaeli, nga Sapanga jongi kabete jojubii ngati wenga, kunani wala pai punndema, wehapa ndi weguhobaleka, ndaba gutimisi lilagi laku nu kwaalangi upali waku wanga na mwisu atumisi baku baatama koni bugujetakye kwa mwoju wabu woti. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Gutimisi lilagi laku legundagila ntumisi waku Daudi ndi atati bangu ku nndomu waku, ena, gawalongila gala ugahengiki lelenu kuuwesu waku wamwete. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Enu sajenu mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, nuguloba kabee gutimisa lilagi lela lewaalagila atati bangu Adaudi pawapwaga, ‘Mu masoba goti ngjwiikosikani mundu mu ukuu waku jojiitama pikiteu su ubambu ukolongu wa Aizilaeli, ana bandu bikibeleku saku biihangalia kuhenga gagapalika palongi jangu ngati eguhengiki wehapa palongi jangu.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Henu, Mwaa Sapanga wa Izilaeli, nuguloba ugatimisa haga goti, gagundagila ntumisi waku Daudi, babube ndi atati bangu.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Henu, mwaa Sapanga, sakaka wiitama pu nndema? Mbona hata kunani kwaka Sapanga kweni nu kunani kwaka Sapanga ngani ngasekugutosa, jagutosa boo, nyumba jenze jenzengike? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Hata hela, mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, ne nuntumisi waku nuguloba gunyowania nepani nu gumbekiya goti ganuguloba lelenu. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Gujilonda nyumba jenze ikilu na muhi, pandu pagupwagiki kubanga, ‘Pamba ndi bandu pabagulumbaliya,’ ili gunyoaninya kila enihika pandu pamba kuloba. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Gunyowanakia kuloba kwangu nepani ntumisi waku nu kuloba kwa bandu baku Aizilaeli pabiiloba koni alingali pandu pamba. Gujowanakia kuloba kwabu kuhumi kunani kwaka Sapanga hoku, na ewibiya gujowani, watulekakia.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Ana mundu ankosi nzaki nukupalika kulapa, anajuhikiki nukulapa palongi ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki litambiku nkati ja nyumba jenze, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />nala, wehapa wanzowania kuhuma kunani kwaku hoku, waatemula akatumisi baku. Jojubii na makosa wandapula kulengana na makosa gaki, na jwanga na makosa wiitangasa kubanga ngasejubii na makosa.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Ana bandu baku Aizilaeli atei kusindwa palongi ja abaja babu, kwa ndaba ju kuguhenge mahakau, na bombi anaahikiki kuloba kulekakewa mahakau nu kulijetake lihina laku nu sukulihulu mu Nyumba jenze, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ndienu waajowania kuhuma kunani hoku, na kwaalekake mahakau bandu baku Aizilaeli nakwakelabu mu nndema gowapekia akahoku babu.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Iyula ana ngasejikuniki kwa ndaba bukutendi mahakau wehapa, ana ahikiki pandu pamba nukuloba kulekakewa nu kulijetake lihina laku, na kugaleka mahakau gabu pawalakaliya, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />ndienu, wajowanakia kuhuma kunani hoku, nu kwaalekake mahakau gaka atumisi baku, bandu buku Izilaeli, koni wabola kupwata indela ja sakaka, wagukunila iyula nndema gongo goguwe waapekiya bandu baku gubiya gwabu.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Ngati anajibii inzala mu nndema au tauni au kusindwa kukuna iyula au ugonzu wi mimea, halwa au mengwa au ana akabaja baayongalwiti mu musi wabu wokapi gola, au ana jijingi homa jokapi, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />gujowana kuloba kukapi kobiiloba bandu baku Aizilaeli, au kojwiiloba mundu jokapi au bandu baku boti buku Izilaeli, kila mundu ana jumanyiki mang'aliku gu mwoju jaki, ana jugulobiki koni jutondabii maboku gaki kulangi mu nyumba jenze, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />ujowana kuhuma kunani hoku kogutama, wandekakia mahakau nukuhenge ngati ekupalika, wanhengila kila mundu ngati mwoju waki egupala, ndaba wehapa kanzika jaku wegumanya mawasu ga mioju ja bandu boti, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />ili bandu baku bugujetakia kipindi soti paatama punndema gowapekia akahoku bitu.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Kabee kipindi nngeni jojuwe ngajumu ja bandu baku Aizilaeli ana ahikiki kuhuma ku nndema ukutali kwa ndaba jukugulumbali wehapa, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />ndaba bandu bi milema jengi biijowana kulumbalika kwaku na namuna egubii na makili nu uwesu waku goguwe wahengi bandu baku, mundu hoju ana juhikiki kuloba mu nyumba jenzeni, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />nuguloba wanzowana kuhuma kunani hoku kogutama, na wanhengila goti gajulobiki, ili bandu boti punndema woti awesa kulimanya lihina laku nukuwesa kugujetake ngati eahenga bandu baku Aizilaeli, na awesa kumanya kubanga Nyumba jenze jenzengiki, ndi pandu pukugulumbali wehapa.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Bandu baku anaapiti kungondu kukomana na akabaja babu kokapi kola kowaapelika, nabombi ana alobiki kulangi musi gouguhagwi na Nyumba jenzengiki jenze kwa ndaba jukugulumbali, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />nuguloba gujowana kuhuma kunani hoku kogutama, kusali kwabu nu kuloba kwabu na wahengila ngati ekupalika.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Ana buguhengi mahakau wehapa, ndaba ngasejubii mundu jwanga kuhenga mahakau, nawe kwaayome nukwaaleka baalapula kungondu hata kwaaleka ajukulika na mu utumwa mbaka kunndema wa akabaja babu gogubii kutali au pambipi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />ebikuba ku ugeni hoku ngati ana bilikelabwi mu mioju jabu sukuloba kulekakewa mahakau koni apwaaga, ‘Tuhengiki mahakau, tuhobiki nukuhenga kihakau,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />kabee pabiikuba mu nndema wa akabaja babu hogu, ana alobiki kulekakewa kwa mwoju wabu woti na kwa loho jabu joti, ana baguloba sukulangi nndema wabu gowapekia akatati babu, nu kulangi musi gongo gouguhagwi na nyumba jenze jenzengiki kwa ndaba jukugulumbali wehapa, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />henu, ukujowania kusali kwabu nuku kuloba kwabu kuhuma kunani hoku, waahengila ngati ekupalika. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Waalekakia bandu baku mahakau gabuguhengi nukugukana kwabu, waabonila ikia palongi ja abaja babu, ili nabombi awesa kwaabone ikia, <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />ndaba haba ndi bandu baku, na mali gaku, bandu bawapiiki kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili kobabia apata mang'aliku.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Gulingalia kuloba kuku ntumisi waku, nu kuloba kwa bandu baku Aizilaeli, waajowania kila paaloba. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Ndaba, mwaa Bambu Sapanga waatengiki na bandu banga Ayaudi ili abiya mali gaku ngati ewatangasa kupete Musa, ntumisi waku, kipindi sewaaboa akahoku bitu mu nndema uku Misili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloba kwa mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Solomoni pajwajomula kusali sala heji joti nu kundoba kwaki Bambu Sapanga, jwajumuka kuhuma palongi ja mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku, pandu pajwabiya jupegiki magoti koni maboku gaki jutondabii kunani. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Jwajemaa na kwaapenge bandu boti Aizilaeli bababiya akusanyiki pala, japwaga kwa sauti ngolongu, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga jojaapeki laha bandu baki Aizilaeli, kulengana na malagi gaki. Jutimisi malagi gaki goti gaamboni gajalagila kupete ntumisi waki Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, jubiya pamu na twepani, ngati ejwabiya na akahoku bitu, tunndoba jwatuleka, wala jwatuleke. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Jombi jujing'anambua mioju jitu, ili tuwesa kupwata indela jaki, koni tupwatiki mihilu jaki, kulongo kwaki na malagalaki gaki gajwaapekia akahoku bitu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Ndienu, malobi gangu aga gaguge ndi kuloba kwangu palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, gabiya pambipi na Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, muwi ni ikilu, najombi anhengila gaamboni ntumisi waki, na bandu baki Aizilaeli, ili awesa kwaajangati mu kila sindu seapala kila masoba. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Ili bandu boti punndema poti biiwesa kumanya kubanga sakaka Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga, wala nga jongi kabete. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Nanamu mmbiya mwabandu bukuhobaleka kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga witu, koni mpwata mihilu jaki nu kujetakee malagalaki gaki goti ngati enhenga lelenu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujipia Nyumba kwaka Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2Majambu gi Ipindi 7:4-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni na Aizilaeli boti bababiya pamu na jombi bumpikia Bambu Sapanga inyama kuba matambiku kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Najombi Solomoni ampikia Bambu Sapanga matambiku gu lukwali ganga, ng'ombi elupu ishilini na mbili na makondoo laki jimu ni ishilini. Ndienu bambu nkolongu na bandu boti buku Izilaeli ebijipia Nyumba kwaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Lisoba lelale bambu nkolongu Solomoni ampikia Sapanga pandu pikilanda ja sumba sa palongi ja Nyumba jaka Bambu, ndaba hapa ndi pajwapiikia matambiku gukutinia, na matambiku gi ilebi na matambiku ga mahuta gu lukwali. Ndaba pandu pukupiiki matambiku papalenganikiwi kwa shaba pala ngasepatosiki kubeka matambiku haga goti.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Najombi Solomoni jwahenga matola gi Indamba masoba saba na masoba saba gangi kabee, pamu na Aizilaeli boti. Bombi baboka kuhuma pandu pukujingali upandi uku kasikazini ku Hamati mbaka kumpaka uku kusini wa losi luku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Mu Lisoba la nani, jwaatabuka bandu, nabombi bumpengila bambu nkolongu, babujania kwabu koni ahinani nu kutogule mioju jabu kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga anhengi majambu gaamboni ntumisi waki Daudi, na kwa bandu baki Aizilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Sapanga ampiti kabee Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2Majambu gi Ipindi 7:11-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni ejajomula kusenga Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, nu kusenga nyumba jaki na hindu yengi yoti yejapala kuhenga, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />Bambu Sapanga ampitila kabee ngati eampitila ku Gibeoni kola. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila bambu nkolongu Solomoni kubanga, “Nyowini kusali kwaku nukuloba kwaku. Nijijetaki nu kujihenga jibia jangu Nyumba jegunzengi ili bandu bililumbalia lihina langu pamba masoba goti. Najilonda nu kujipala kipindi soti. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Wehapa ana gubii mwoju wasapi kwangu na kuba woguhobaleka ngati atati baku Adaudi, nu gujetaki mihilu jangu nu kuhenga goti ganugulagalaki, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />nepani nagugangamalisa ulongosi waku kwa bandu buku Izilaeli masoba ganga na mwisu, ngati enaalagila atati baku Adaudi, napwaga, ngawikosi mundu jukulongosa mu ubambu uku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Lakini wehapa au bana baku anaang'anambwiki nu kukotoka kumbwata nu kujileka mihilu na malagalaki gangu ganumpekia nu kujenda kuitumaki isapanga yengi nu kuilumbali, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />ndienu, naahamisa bandu bangu, Aizilaeli, kuhuma munndema gongo gonumpeki, nu kujikana Nyumba jenze jenijijetakia kuba jangu, najilekalia kutali na nepani najihenga kuba sindu siking'ang'a nu kujitondo palongi ja bandu banga Aizilaeli boti. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Hata ngati nyumba jenze jinyambiki ngani sajenu, jiibombuka na kuba mang'oba, na kila jojipeta pambipi jitenda kusituka nu kunyua kimutu, nu kulaluki, ‘Ndaba jakii Bambu Sapanga juhengiki ana, mu nndema ago na mu nyumba ajeje?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Bandu biijibua, ‘Ndaba bunndei Bambu Sapanga wabu, jojaapia akahoku babu ku nndema uku Misili, nu kuipwata isapanga yengi, biigungamalia nu kuitumakia, ndienu Bambu Sapanga jwaleti mag'aliku haga goti.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujetangane kwaka Solomoni na bambu nkolongu Hilamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:1-2">2Majambu gi Ipindi 8:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Eyapeta yaka ishilini, yeyuye bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwasengiki nyumba ibeli, yani nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga na nyumba jaki, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />bambu nkolongu Solomoni ampekia bambu nkolongu Hilamu juku Tilu misi ishilini, mu nkoa uku Galilaya kwa ndaba bambu Hilamu jabiya jumpelaki Solomoni imbau yimikongu mielezi ni miboleshi, na zahabu yejapala. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Lakini bambu Hilamu ejahika kuhuma ku Tilu nukujibona misi heji jejabiya ampeki ngasejujipaile. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Hilamu andalukia bambu nkolongo Solomoni, “Nndongu wango misi boo, jegumbeki?” Najwombi Hilamu jujikema misi heji Kabuli, manajaki misi janga na mana, lihina heli libii mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Bambu nkolongu Hilamu jabiya ampelaki bambu nkolongu Solomoni zahabu kilu elupu itatu na mia sita.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu gangi gaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2Majambu gi Ipindi 8:3-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Mahengu gaka bambu Solomoni gajaapekiya bandu ahenga sakwaalasimisa ndi ganga, jasenga Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, na nyumba jaki, na ngomi ja Milo, nu lumatu luku Yelusalemu, nu kusenga kabee misi juku Hazoli na Megido na Gezeli, <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Gezeli ndi musi gojwabiya jugukamwi bambu nkolongu juku Misili, jwabiya jugukamwi nu kugujosa mwotu na kwaakoma Akaanani bandu baabiya atama homu. Monikatai, bambu nkolongu Solomoni pajwabia antoi kamwali waka Falau, bambu nkolongu Falau ampekia musi hogu kamwali waki kuba nhupi ja ndoa jaki. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Solomoni jugusenga maa musi wa Gezeli, na kabee jugusenga musi uku Beti Holoni wa pai, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />na misi juku Balati nuku Tamali musi gowabii kulungweza mu nndema uku Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />kabee na misi joti jijihenga kuba ikoku, kwa ndaba ja falasi yaki na magali gaki gukugahuta, kabee jasenga sindu sokapi sejwapala mu musi uku Yelusalemu, nuku Lebanoni au kongi kokapi mu ubambu ukulongu waki. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Bandu bangi babahigaliya bababi nga Aizilaeli ndi babiya, Aamoli na Ahiti na Apelizi na Ahivi na Ayebusi, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />pamu ni ibeleku yabu yeyuye Aizilaeli ngasebawesiki kwaakoma, bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwaahenga abiya atumwa mbaka lelenu. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Lakini Solomoni ngasejwaanhengiki kuba atumwa bandu bokapi buku Izilaeli, bombi ndi babiya akomana ngondu baki, na akatumisi baki na akakilongosi baakomana ngondu baki, akaakomana ngondu ba magali gaki gukugahuta, na baakwelale falasi.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Kabee babia akakilongosi akolongu babajemale mahengu gukusenga gaka Solomoni, kabee kwabiya na akakilongosi mia nhwanu na hamusini, bababiya baajemalia bandu baahenga mahengu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Kamwali waka Falau pa juguhama musi waka Daudi, nukujenda kunyumba jaki jikibambu, jejuje Solomoni jatenda kunsenge, ndienu Solomoni jwasenga ngomi ja Milo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Solomoni jwabia jupia matambiku gukutini na matambiku gu lukwali panani ja mesa jamalibu jukupiiki matambiku mala pa tatu mu kila saka pandu pansengi Bambu Sapanga, nu kumpogale ubani, ndienu jajomuliya kusenga Nyumba jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalenganakia meli hingi ku misi ja Esioni Gebeli, pambipi na musi uku Eloti gowabii ku nnkenga ju nhanga nkolongu wa Shamu, mu nndema uku Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Najombi bambu nkolongu Hilamu jwaatuma aka kilongosi baki na nabombi bahenga lihengu mu meli pamu na atumisi baka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Bajenda mbaka ku nndema uku Ofili, nu kujuku zahabu kilu elupu komi nu nsesi, nu kundete bambu nkolongu Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Malikia juku Sheba antembalee Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Majambu gi Ipindi 9:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Malikia juku Sheba ejajowana kumanyikana kwaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni, kwa ndaba juku jongana kwaki na Bambu Sapanga, jajenda kwaka Solomoni ili kunndenga sukundaluki maswali gaganonwipi. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Jahika ku musi uku Yelusalemu koni jubii na bandu bingi pamu na ngamia yeyabiya itotwi hindu yeinungi ngani na madini ga zahabu pamu na nhupi na hindu yingi ya bei ngolongu. Nukulonge naku goti gagabii mu mwoju waki. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Najombi Solomoni anzibua maswali gaki goti gaandaluki, na ngaselabii lijambu lokapi lejwasindwa kunzibu. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Malikia juku Sheba jwasangii ngamaa pajamanya umanyi waka Solomoni na ejujibona nyumba jejabia jusengiki, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />na kabee ejalinga posu jebaleta pamesa jaki, na namuna akakilongosi ba pai jaki ebatama pamesa, na namuna akaatumisi baki ebawatali sapi, na kabee ebabiya abaga hindu ya kunywa na matambiku gabu gukutinia gajabiya jutenda kupiya mu nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, jwasangii ngamaa.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Ndienu ampwagila bambu nkolongu Solomoni, “Kuneng'ane kwaku nu umanyi waku na majambu goti ganagajowana panabii ku nndema wangu ndi ga sakaka! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Lakini ngasenawesa kuhobale majambu haga mbaka enhikiki nukulinga na mweti. Kumbi ngase bambwagi hata nusu jaki, umanyi waku na mali gaku gapetiki majambu gabambwagila. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Apengiwi bandu baku! Na apengiwi akaatumisi baku baajema palongi jaku nu kujowanake umanyi waku kipindi soti! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Julumbalika Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku, jojugupai wehapa, jugubei mu kiteu su ubambu ukolongu wa Aizilaeli! Kwa ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwaapai Aizilaeli yaka yanga na mwisu, jugubei wehapa kuba wabambu nkolongu, ili guendalia kutunza malagalaki na wamboni.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Ndienu Malikia juku Sheba ampekia Solomoni zahabu kilu elupu nsesi nukupeta, na hindu yeinungi yingipi malibu ga bei ngolongu. Hindu yeinungi yingipi ngati yela yeandeti bambu nkolongu Solomoni ngaseiwaiki kupitii kabee.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Kabee sapwali ja meli yaka Hilamu yeyaleta zahabu kuhuma ku musi uku Ofili, yaleta mipendi jingipi junkongu nsandali na malibu ga bei ngolongu. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Najombi bambu nkolongu jijitumia mikongu ji misandali kuba mipengu mu Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, na ja nyumba jaki na kwa ndaba jukulenganake ilimba na zeze ya bandu baajemba. Mipengu ju nkongu nsandali jingi ngati aje ngasejibonikini kabete mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni ampekia Malikia juku Sheba kila sindu sejatokulia na sejwaloba, pamu na hindu yengi yeyuye Solomoni jaamua kumpeke kulengana na eayobali akabambu akolongu kuhenga. Ndienu Malikia juku Sheba jwakelabuka mu nndema waki pamu na atumisi baki.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mali gingi gaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2Majambu gi Ipindi 9:13-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Kila saka Solomoni bundetila zahabu kilu elupu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Pamu naheyi jajopa kabee kodi kwa bandu baalomba nu kulombesa, kwa akabambu akolongu boti buku Alabia na akolongu bi mikoa juku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwalenganakia ngau mia mbili ya zahabu sukuponda, kila ngau jimu kutopa kwaki kwabiya kilu saba ja zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Jalenganakia ngau isoku soku mia tatu kwa zahabu jukuponda, kila ngau jabiya na kilu jimu na nusu, ndi bambu nkolongu jiibeka mu nyumba jimu jebijikema Nyumba jumu Kiholi suku Lebanoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Kabee bambu nkolongu jwalenganakia kiteu kikolongu sikibambu sekibii na manyelu, jwikipakia zahabu sapi. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Kiteu hesi sabiya na ngasi sita. Pandu panani paki pabiya paingaliwi upandi ukunyuma na sabiya na pandu pukujegamane maboku, na pandu poti pabeli pabiya ni imong'umong'u ya mahimba mabeli kila kimong'umong'u simu sajema upandi gongo na sengi upandi gongi ukujegame kuboku. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Kwabiya kabee ni imong'umong'u komi ni ibeli ya mahimba yeyabiya ijemiki, kila ngazi jimu yabiya ijemiki ibeli upandi ago nu upandi gongo. Kiteu su ubambu ukolongu ngati hesi ngasekiwaiki kulenganakewa mu ubambu wokapi gola.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Ikombi yoti yukunywele divai yaka bambu nkolongu Solomoni yabiya ya zahabu na yombu yoti yeyabiya mu nyumba ji Kiholi sa Lebanoni yabiya ya zahabu sapi. Ngasesabii sindu sealenganaki kwa madini ga feza ndaba madini ga feza ngasegabii na bei ngolongu ku kipindi hesi. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Kwa ndaba bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwabii na meli yingi yeyabia ijenda ku Talishishi pamu na meli yaka bambu nkolongu Hilamu, kila saka sa tatu yundetila Solomoni zahabu, na madini ga feza na manyelu ndembu na majani makolongu na masoku ni ijuni yebiikema Tausi.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwaapeta akabambu akolongu boti bupu nndema kwa kuba na mali gingi. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Bandu bupundema woti babiha na hamu jukunzende Solomoni ili kuubona umanyi yaki goguwe Bambu Sapanga antei kumpeke. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Kila jumu wabu anndetila nhupi ya yombu ya madini ga feza na zahabu ni ingobu na hindu yukunungi ya bei ngolongu yebiikema manemane na hindu yukukomane ngondu na falasi na nyumbu kila saka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Solomoni jwakusanya magali gukuhutwa na falasi na baakwelale inyama heyi, jwabiya na magali ga falasi elupu jimu na nne na baakwelale inyama heyi babiya elupu komi na mbili babube jwaabeka mu misi jejibii na pandu pukubeke magali ga falasi na magali gangi jagabeka ku musi uku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jagahenga madini ga feza gabia gingi ngati pe malibu gangi gagayobaliki, ni imbau yunkongu mwelezi yabiya hingi ngati pe imbau imikongu ju nkoju jejimela mulutengu ju nhanga. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Solomoni jwalagalakia falasi kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili, nu kuhuma ku musi uku Kilikia kokuje bandu baki baalomba na baalombesa baalombasiya kwa bei ngolongu. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Ligali limu lukuhutwa kunndema uku Misili hoku babiya alomba kwa kilu saba ya madini ga feza na falasi jimu alomba kwa madini ga feza kilu ibeli. Babunhenge mahengu gukulomba nukulombesa baka bambu nkolongu apelika magali na falasi heyi kwaalombase akabambu akolongu boti bi milema ja Ahiti na Asilia.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni jujileka indela jaka Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Bambu nkolongu Solomoni jwaapai ngamaa akambomba biki geni. Ampala kamwali waka bambu nkolongu Falau, kabee jwaapala akambomba buku Moabu na buku Amoni na buku Edomu na Asidoni na Ahiti. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Akambomba bu nndema goguwe Bambu Sapanga jwaakanakia Aizilaeli koni jupwaga, “Mwaajuku akambomba kwabu wala bombi biitola akambomba kwinu, ndaba akambomba haba bankolua mwanganya mwiitumaki isapanga yabu.” Hata ela Solomoni jwaapai ngamaa akambomba bi kigeni. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Solomoni jwabii na akambomba mia saba, boti babiya aka kamwali bikibambu na jabiya kabee na akambomba mia tatu bababia atumisi baki. Akambomba haba bunhenga Solomoni jujileka indele jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Solomoni pajabii nseja, akahanu baki bunkolua juitumakia isapanga yengi, wala ngase jwahengiki majambu gagunndengani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki kabee, ngati atati baki Adaudi ebahenga. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Ndienu, Solomoni jwikitumakia kisapanga sa mbomba sa bandu buku Sidoni sebikikema Ashitaloti na akilumbalia kisapanga Moleki, kisapanga sesuse Aamoni pabikilumbalia kwabiya matondu kwaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Henu, Solomoni jwahenga ubaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, wala ngaseampwatiki Bambu Sapanga sapi ngati atati baki Adaudi ebahenga. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Panani jikitombi sesabii upandi golipiti lyoba uku musi wa Yelusalemu, Solomoni jupasenga pandu pukukimbali kisapanga sebikikema Kemoshi, sa bandu buku Moabu papupe Amohabu pababia akipiiki matambiku lihengu heli labia matondu kwaka Bambu Sapanga na kabee jasenga pandu pukumpiiki matambiku kisapanga Moleki sa bandu buku Amoni, lihengu heli labia matondu kwaka Bambu Sapanga <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Kabee jwaasengila akaahanu baki boti bi kigeni pandu pukupogale ubani na pukupiiki matambiku isapanga yabu.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Ndienu, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, anhengila inyela Solomoni, kwa ndaba ngasejwaendali kundumbali Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli kanzika jaki, jojabiya ampiti mala pabeli, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />hata ngati Bambu Sapanga andakalia jwiilumbali isapanga yengi, lakini Solomoni ngasejwapwatiki mihilu heji. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Ndienu Bambu Sapanga ampwagila Solomoni, “Kwa ndaba guamwi kuhenga ngati henugulagalaki, nu kulitunu lilaganu langu lenilihengiki na wehapa, nu kusindwa kupwata mihilu jangu nu kungana, sakaka isinugubalula ubambu wakuipandi ibeli nukumpeke jumwa kati ja atumisi baku. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Hata hela, kwa ndaba ja Atati baku Adaudi, ngahengi hela mu kutamaa kwaku, ilakini nagubalula ubambu hogu pajwiilongusa mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Hata hela nganagubalu ubambu woti, lakini nandekila mwana waku bandu bi likabila limu, kwa ndaba juku ntumisi wangu Daudi, na kwa ndaba ja musi uku Yelusalemu goguwe nuguhagwi gubiya gwangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abaja baka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Bambu Sapanga anhenga Hadadi jojabii julukolu lwaka bambu nkolongu juku Edomu, kuba mbaja waka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Kipindi Daudi pajwabia ku Edomu, Yoabu jojwabii nkolongu wa alonda jwajenda hoku kwaataga Aizalaeli bababia baakomiki ku ngondu, ndaba Yoabu jwabia jwaakomiki akanalomi boti buku Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabu na Aizilaeli boti batama hoku kwa miei sita, mbaka pajwajomula kwakoma akanalomi boti buku Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Lakini Hadadi jojwabii nkombu kipindi sela jwatilila ku nndema uku Misili pamu na bandu asokopi buku Edomu, akatumisi baatati baki. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Hadadi na ajaki bajenda kuhuma ku Midiani jwaajukua bandu bangi ku Palani, bajenda nabu mbaka ku Misili kwaka bambu nkolongu Falau. Najombi ampekia Hadadi nyumba, jwalagalakiya ampekia posu, na ampekiwa pandu pukutama. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Falau ampai ngamaa Hadadi, na ampekia nndamu waki nnuna waka malikia Tepenesi nhwanu waka Falau, Hadadi anzukua jubiya nhanu waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Nndongu uka malikia Tepenesi hoju ampapila Hadadi mwana joankema Genubati. Genubati jwakolila na bana bikibambu kwaka malikia Tapenesi mu nyumba jaka Falau, pamu na bana bikibambu.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Hadadi pajwabia ku misili jajowana kubanga Daudi na Yoabu nkolongu jwa akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli, akuwiki, ampwagila Falau, “Guneka muja kunndema wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Lakini Falau andalukia, “Boo, gukosiki sindu bole mbaka gupala kubuja ku nndema wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Najombi Hadadi ampembalakia sukupwaga, “Gunekakia pe nyendaje.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Sapanga anhenga kabe Lezoni mwana uka Eliada, jubiya mmbaja waka Solomoni. Lezoni jwabiya antiliki bambu waki, bambu Hadadezeli juku Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Daudi ejabiya jaakomiki bandu buku Soba, Lezoni jwaakusanya bandu kuunda likundi lahuni, najombi ndi jwabiya kilongosi wabu. Ndienu bajenda ku Damasiko, nukugukamu musi nukugulongosa. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Lezoni jwabiya mmbaja wa Aizilaeli mu masoba goti gu ubambu uka Solomoni, anhengila ubaja ngani Solomoni ngati hejwahenga Hadadi. Ndienu Lezoni jwalongusa ku Silia koni jwaasuka ngamaa bandu Aizilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sapanga andagi Yeloboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Yeleboamu mwana uka Nebati, jojabii jwilikabila la Efulaimu juku Seleda, ntumisi waka Solomoni, jojuwe amabu baki bababia mmbomba jo awii alami baki babaakemika Zelua, na kabee ankana bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Hela ndi Yeleboamu eankana bambu nkolongu Solomoni. Solomoni jwayelalia mabomba nukusenga ngasi yebiikema Milo, yeyajenda ku lumatu lwa musi uka Daudi, atati baki, <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yelobuamu jwabonikana kuba nkombu jojubii nganganganga na jojubii na makili. Ndienu Solomoni pajwabona kubanga nkombu hoju jukasana ngamaa kuhenga mahengu, ndi ambeka jubiya jujemale bandu baahenga lihengu sukulasimiswa lebabiya ahenga bandu bulukolu lwaka Josefu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Lisoba limu Yelobuamu pajwabiya nsapwali kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, nndota jobunkema Ahiya juku Shilu jwaketanga naku mwiindela koni jubii kanzika. Ahiya jwabiya juweti ingobu inyai. Boti abeli babiya kanzika jabu kumigonda. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ndienu, Ahiya jahula ingobu jaki inyai, nu kulijendulana ipandi komi ni ibeli, <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />ndienu, ampwagila Yelobuamu ana, “Ujukua ipandi komi, ndaba Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, jupwaga anana, ‘Linga, nyenda kugubalulana ubambu ukolongu uka Solomoni nukumpeke mwanganya mwa bandu ba makabila komi.’ <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Lakini jwombi nanndekila likabila limu kwa ndaba jaka Daudi ntumisi wangu, na kwa ndaba ja musi uku Yelusalemu gonugusagwi gubiya gwangu mu makabila goti ga Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Niihenga hela ndaba Solomoni jutei kuneka, nukuilumbali isapanga ikigeni yebiikema Ashitaloti kisapanga sambomba sa bandu buku Sidoni ni kisapanga Kemoshi sa bandu buku Moabu ni kisapanga Moleki sa bandu buku Amoni. Solomoni junganiki nepani, nu kuhenga kihakau palongi jangu, wala ngasejwapwatiki mihilu jangu na malagalaki gangu ngati Daudi atati baki ebahenga. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Hata hela nganannyagi ubambu woti, ndaba nunhengiki jubia bambu nkolongu mu masoba gukutama kwaki kwoti kwa ndaba jaka Daudi ntumisi wangu jonabiya nunhagwi, na jombi jwapwatiki mihilu jangu na malagalaki gangu. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Lakini nannyaga mwana waki ubambu ukolongu hogu, na nepani nagupekia wehapa makabila komi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Mwana waka Solomoni hoju nanndekila likabila limu, ili kipindi soti mu kibeleku sukuntumisi wangu Daudi jwiibiya mundu jojulongosa ku Yelusalemu, musi gonuhagula gubia pandu pangu pukunumbali. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Ndienu, wa Yelobuamu, naguhenga gubiya wa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, nanagu wiilongusa kulengana na ewipala. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Ana guhengiki goti ganagulagalakia, ana gupwatiki ndela jangu nepani, nukuhenga gaamboni palongi jangu, su kupwata mihilu jangu na malagalaki gangu ngati ntumisi wa Daudi ejahenga, ndienu nepani niibiya na wehapa kipindi soti. Nakusengila lukolu lu ubambu lolwitama yaka yingi ngati enuhengila Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Ndienu kulengana na haga naang'alisa bana baka Daudi, lakini nga kipindi soti.”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Kwa ndaba heji, Solomoni jwalenga kunkoma Yelobuamu, lakini Yelobuamu jwatilila ku Misili kuka bambu nkolongu Shishaki, jwatama hoku mbaka Solomoni pajwakuwa.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2Majambu gi Ipindi 9:29-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Majambu gangi gajahengiki Solomoni nu umanyi waki, goti gaandikwi mu kitabu sa mahengu gaka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomoni jwalongusa yaka alubaini mu nndema woti uku Izilaeli, koni jutama ku musi uku Yelusalemu <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Ndienu, Solomoni jatenda kuwa, buntaga ku musi uka Daudi atati baki. Lehoboamu, mwana waka Solomoni, jwalongusa badala jaki.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Aizilaeli bunkana Lehobuamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2Majambu gi Ipindi 10:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Ndienu, Lehobuamu jwajenda ku Shekemu kobabiya akusanyiki bandu boti buku Izalaeli ili kuhimika jubiya bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Najombi Yelobuamu mwana uka Nebati ejapata majambu gi lihengu heli ndaba jabii jwakoli ku nndema uku Misili kojabiya jupiti kipindi paantila bambu nkolongu Solomoni, jwabuja kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Lakini Aizilaeli buntuma mundu kunkema. Ndienu jombi na bandu boti buku Izilaeli bajenda kuka Lehobuamu, nu kumpwagila, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Atati baku bututumikisa ngati twaatumwa na jutulepisa kodi jingipi. Ndienu gutupungasia nsigu hogo, na twepani twiitenda kugutumakila.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Najombi Lehobuamu jwajibua ana, “Nzendania, mwiihikania pa malabu.” Ndienu batenda kubokanela.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Lehobuamu jwaalalukia akaseja bababiya baatumaki atati baki Solomoni kipindi sa womi waki, jwaalalukia, “Mmbwagila naajibwa boo, bandu bambane?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Aseja haba bunzibua ana, “Ngati ana lelenu gupala kwatumaki sapi, ndienu wajibua sapi nabombi bagutumakia kipindi soti.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Lakini Lehobuamu jakana majambu gabapwaga aseja bala, badala jaki jwaajendila akakombu ajaki bababia pamu najombi na kabe bababia atenda kuntumaki.<verse eid="1KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Ndienu jwaalalukia, “Mwanganya mpwaga lijambu boo lakwaajibu bandu haba baambwagili naapungusia lihengu lelule atati bangu babia baapeki ahengsje?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Akakombu haba bunzibua, “Bandu haba babugupwagi kubanga atati baku baatwekiki nsigu gogutopiki, nukuguloba waapungasia nsigu hogu, wehapa waapwagila ana, ‘Waapwagila wehapawaapekia lihengu lelinonwipi ngani kupeta lihengu lebaapekia atati baku. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Atati bangu bumpekia lihengu lelinonwipi lakini nepani nampekia lihengu lelinonwiipi ngani. Atati bangu bunndapula ndonga, lakini nepani nundapula ndonga yeibii na miya.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Ndienu lisoba la tatu Yelobuamu pamu na bandu boti bajenda kuka Lehobuamu ngati ejabiya jaalagalaki. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Bambu nkolongu jwaajibua bandu haba sukulakali, ngasejwapwatiki majambu gabumpwagila aseja bala, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />jwagapwata majambu gaalongila akakombu ajaki, jwaapwagila ana, “Atati bangu bunhengisi mahengu gaganonwipi, lakini nepani nanhengisa mahengu gaganonwipi ngani. Atati bangu bundapwi iboku, lakini nepani isinundapula iboku yeibi na miya.”<verse eid="1KI 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu ngasejajowani bandu kwa ndaba lijambu heli labiya lihumiki kwaka Bambu Sapanga, ili julitimisa lilobi laki leampwagila Yelobuamu mwana uka Nebati, kupete nndota jobunkema Ahiya juku musi uku Shilu.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Lakini bandu boti buku Izilaeli ebabona bambu nkolongu ngase jwajowanela, bunpwagila ana, “Ngasetubii nu ulongu wokapi na Daudi! Ngasetubii napandu pitu kuhuma kuka mwana waka Yese. Mmbujania kunyumba, mwaa bandu buku Izilaeli! Mwaa Adaudi mwilitunza jinu mwabeti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Ndienu, bandu buku Izalaeli babujania mu manyumba gabu. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Bandu buku Izilaeli bababiya atama ku misi yu nndema uku Yuda, ndi babahigalia mu ulongosi uka Lehobuamu.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Ndienu Bambu nkolongu Lehoboamu antuma Adolamu, jojabii jojujemale lihengu lukulasimisa, bandu boti buku Izilaeli bundapula imabu nu kunkoma. Najombi Lehobuamu wakwela ligali laki lukuhutwa na falasi nu kutili ku Yelusalemu kanyata. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Hela ndi bandu buku Izilaeli ebulukana lukolu lwaka Daudi mbaka lelenu.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Bandu boti buku Izilaeli ebajowana kubanga Yelobuamu jubujiki kuhuma ku nndema uku Misili. Bunkema kunkutanu wa bandu, bunhimika jubiya bambu nkolongu ju nndema woti wa Aizilaeli. Ngaselabii likabila lengi lelajongana nu ukoo waka Daudi ila pee likabila la Yuda kajika jaki lelabiya lunnzetaki Daudi.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota waka Shemaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2Majambu gi Ipindi 11:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Lehobuamu pajwahika ku Yelusalemu, jwakusanya akomana ngondu baabi na makili laki jimu na elupu semanini ba makabila ga Yuda na Benjamini, ili kukomana na Aizilaeli, ili juwesa kugukelabu ubambu waka Lehobuamu, mwana waka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Lakini lilobi laka Sapanga lunhikila Shemaya, mundu waka Sapanga kubanga, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Gumpwagila Lehobuamu mwana waka Solomoni, bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, na bandu boti bi likabila laka Yuda na Benjamini na bandu bangi boti, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Mwiikomana na alongu binu Aizilaeli. Kila mundu jubuja kunyumba jaki, ndaba lijambu heli lihumiki kwangu nepani.’” Boti bajetakiya malagalaki gaka Sapanga na kila mundu jabuja kunyumba jaki kabe.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu andeka Bambu Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu juku Izilaeli jugusenga kabee musi uku Shekemu kukitombi suku Efulaimu nukutama hoku na jajenda kugusenga musi uku Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu jatumbulia kuholale holale koni jupwaga, “Sajenu ubambu ukolongu guwesa kukelabuka kwa bandu bu lukolu lwaka Daudi, <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />ana bandu haba biendalia kujenda kupiya matambiku ku nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga ku musi uku Yelusalemu. Mioju jabu janng'anambukia bambu wabu Lehobuamu bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, nabombi biingoma nepani.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu baada jukulonge na bandu bangi, jalenganakia imong'umong'u ibeli ya matoli ga ng'ombi kwa zahabu. Ndienu jwaapwagila bandu, “Mwabandu buku Izilaeli kunonwipi ngamaa kwiinu mwanganya kukwela kujenda ku musi Yelusalemu. Linga, yenze ndi isapanga yinu yeyumpiya kunndema uku Misili, mwiijenda kabe ku musi uku Yelusalemu kupia matambiku hoku.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Kimong'umong'u simu si litoli la ng'ombi jwikibeka ku musi uku Beseli, ni kimong'umong'u sa pili jwikibeka ku musi wa Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Lihengu heli labia kihakau, ndaba bandu bajenda kuipiiki imong'umong'u heyi matambiku ku Beseli nuku Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Kabee, bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu jasenga nyumba panani ji itombi nu kwaahagu akagolu banga bi likabila la Alawi.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulumbali ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yelobuamu kabee jwalagalakia lisoba la kumi na tanu la mwei wa nani gabiya matola, ngati matola gagabiya gahengeka ku nndema uku Yuda. Jwapiya matambiku pa mesa ja malibu jejabii pandu payabi imong'umong'u ya matoli ga ng'ombi ya zahabu yeyabiya ku Beseli. Kabe jwahagula akagolu na kwaabeka kila pandu piitombi pukupiiki matambiku kwikimong'umong'u sekibii ku Beteli. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Lisoba la komi na tanu la mwei wa nani, lejilihagula mweni, najombi jajenda ku Beseli kupiya matambiku. Ndinu ejatumbulia henga matola haga gajwagabeka kwa ndaba ja Aizilaeli, na mweni jwakwela panani ja pandu pukupiiki matambiku nu kupogale ubani.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Lisoba limu bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu jwabiya jujemiki pandu pukupiiki matambiku ili jupogalia ubani. Ndienu mundu waka Sapanga kuhuma ku Yuda jahika papu na malobi gaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Mundu jola jajamalia pandu pukupiiki matambiku pala koni jupwaga, “Wehapa wapandu pukupiiki matambiku! Pamba Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Jwiisaliwa mwana mu lukolu lwaka Daudi, lihina laki ndi Yosia. Hoju jwaajukua akagolu baahenga lihengu pandu pukulumbali nu kupogale ubani panani jaku, nu kupiya matambiku panani jaku, ena, mahupa ga bandu biitinia panani jaki!’” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Mundu hoju jalangia nginyuli lisoba lelale sukupwaga, “Pandu pamalibu pukupiiki matambiku pamba piitenda kubomboka, ni liliu lelibii panani jaki litenda kujitika.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu ejajowana malobi haga gajalongila mundu waka Sapanga kwa ndaba ja pandu pukupiiki matambiku ku Beseli, jwalangia kuboku nukupwaga, “Munkamula hoju!” Ndienu palapa kuboku kwaki kojanyosiki hoku kwatenda kujoma, ngasejawesa kabe kugonza. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Napombi pandu pukupiiki matambiku hapa patenda kubomboka, ni liliu laki latenda kujitika pai, ngati nginyuli jela jejalongila mundu waka Sapanga hoju na majambu gajalongila Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu ampwagila mundu waka Sapanga, “Gupepa koku, nagunobe kuka Bambu Sapanga Sapanga waku, kuboku kwangu kuwesa kulama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:6">Najombi mundu waka Sapanga, nu kuboku kuka bambu nkolongu kwatenda kulama, na kuba ngati ejabii puuwanzu. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu apwagila mundu waka Sapanga, “Hegalia pa nyumba jangu gukula posu, na nepani nugupekia unhupi.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Lakini mundu waka Bambu Sapanga apwagila, “Hata ngati gumbeke nusu ja mali gaku, nganyendi pamu na wehapa. Nganguli wala kunywa masi pandu pambane, <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />ndaba Bambu Sapanga jambwagila niikula posu wala kunywa masi, wala niikelabuka kwiindela jelaje jenahikila pamba.” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Ndienu mundu hoju jwatenda kuboka, wala ngase jwakelabuka kwiindela jelaje jejahikilaje juku Beseli.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndota nseja juku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Kipindi hesi jwabii nndota nseja ku Beseli. Bana baki bunzendila nukundandi majambu goti gajahenga mundu waka Sapanga jola, lisoba lela ku Beseli, ampwagila kabee majambu goti gajabia ampwagi bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Atati babu jwaalalukia ana, “Jupetiki indela bole?” Nabombi bana baki bundangia indela jejupetiki mundu waka Sapanga hoju kuhuma ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Najombi jwaapwagila bana baki, “Nhandalia liponda.” Nabombi bunhandalia liponda, nu nseja jola jwakwelalia panani jaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />Ampwata mundu waka Sapanga hoju anketania jutemi pu nkongu gobugukema mwaloni. Ndienu andalukia, “Gwehapa lee wamundu waka Sapanga kuhuma ku Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Najombi jwajibua, “Eena! Nenganenga.” <verse eid="1KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Nseja jola ampwagila ana, “Tumboka kunyumba jangu ili gukula posu.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Lakini jwombi ampwagila, “Ngawesi kubuja pamu na wehapa, wala kujingi mu nyumba jaku. Nganhwesi kula posu wala kunywa masi pandu pamba, <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />ndaba Bambu Sapanga jwambwagila niikula posu wala kunywa masi pandu pambane, wala niikelabuka kwiindela jenahikila.”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Ndota nseja juku Beseli hoju ampwagila ana, “Nepani nu nndota ngati wehapa, na Bambu Sapanga julongi na nepani kwiindela juku ntumisi jukunani kupwaga, ‘Gunkelabua kunyumba jangu jukula posu na kunywa masi.’” Lakini nndota nseja hojo jabiya jutenda kunkonga pena.<verse eid="1KI 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Ndienu, mundu waka Sapanga jola jabuja pamu najombi, jwakula posu na kunywa masi ku nyumba juku ndota nseja jola.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Ebabiya pa mesa, lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila nndota nseja joankelabua mundu waka Sapanga jola, <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />najombi ampwagila mundu waka Sapanga juku Yuda kubanga, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Wehapa gukotwiki kupwata lilobii laka Bambu Sapanga, na ngasegupwatiki malagalaki gajugulagalakia Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Badala jaki gukelabwiki pamba, kula posu na kunywa masi pandu pamba panugupwagila wiikula posu wala kunywa masi. Ndienu, ntuhi waku ngabagutagi ku matenge gaka hoku bako.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Ejajomula kula, nndota nnseja hoju anhandalia liponda mundu waka Sapanga hoju, najombi jatenda kuboka. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Ejabiya mwiindela, jwaketangana ni lihimba latenda kunkoma, ntuhi waki wabiya buguleki pi indela, liponda laki ni lihimba lela labiya lijemiki pulutengu jaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Bandu babapeta hapu nukugubona ntuhi hogu guhabuki piindela, ni lihimba lijemiki pambipi jaki, bajenda mbaka ku musi kojabiya jutama nndota nseja jola, nukwaalandi bandu.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Ndota nseja jola jojabia ankemiki kunyumba jaki ejajowana majambu haga, japwaga, “Ajo ndi mundu waka Sapanga jola jojasindwa kupwata lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga! Bambu Sapanga antumi lihimba, luntukalia nukunkoma ngati ejabiya ampwagi.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Hapa ndi jaapwagila bana baki, “Nhandalia liponda.” Nabombi batenda kunhandali. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Nseja jola jajenda nukugukole ntuhi waka mundu jwaka Sapanga mwiindela, lihimba ni liponda laki ibii pulutengu jaki, lihimba heli ngaselakuliki ntuhi hogu wala kulitukali liponda lela. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Ndienu, nndota nseja jola jugujukua ntuhi waka mundu jwaka Sapanga jola, nukugubeka panani jiliponda laki, nukugukelabu ku musi waki, ili kundele kuwa kwaki nukuntaga. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ndienu buntaga pi litenge laki, bundelila koni apwaga, “Oo! Nndongu wito tugubone ikia, gunndongu witu!” <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Ebabiya buntagiki, ndota nseja hoju jaapwagila bana baki, “Enikuwa mwindaga mu litenge lende lituntagiki mundu waka Sapanga jonzo, mahupa gangu mwagabeka pulutengu ja mahupa gaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Majambu goti gaguge Bambu Sapanga jabiya jupwagiki kupete pandu pukupiiki matambiku puku Beseli, na pandu poti pukupiiki matambiku kwiitombi ku misi juku Samalia, sakaka giitenda kuhengeka.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahakau makolongu gaka Yelobuamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Baada ja haga goti bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu ngasejwakotwiki kuhenga ubaja, ila jwaendalia kwaahagu bandu banga kuba Alawi kuba aka agolu, ahenga lihengu pandu pukupiiki matambiku ku itombi. Mundu jokapi jola jojwapala kuba ngolu ahimika kuba ngolu ili juhenga lihengu lukumpiiki matambiku ku itombi. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Kihakau hesi suluhenga lukolu lwaka Yelobuamu kuabuka nukuguhoa mbaka ngasewabonika pu nndema.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwana waka Yelobuamu jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Kipindi hesi, Abiya mwana waka bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu, jwabiya nngonzu. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yelobuamu ampwagila nhanu waki, “Gujenda ukalikopakia kuba ngati wa mundu jongi, ili bandu biimanya ngati wehapa unhwanu uka bambu nkolongu nu kujenda ku musi uku Shilu kojutama nndota Ahiya jojapwaga kubanga nepani isimiya bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Gumpelakia mabumunda komi, na maandasi masokopi na busi lisupa limu. Jwombi jwagupwagila majambu gagampata mwana witu.<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Ndienu, nhwanu waka bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu jwatenda kuboka, jwajenda ku Shilu kunyumba jaka Ahiya. Kipindi hesi, Ahiya ngasejuwesika kulinga sapi kwa ndaba jabii nseja. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Bambu Sapanga jwabiya ampwagi Ahiya kubanga nhwanu waka bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu jubii mwiindela, juhika kulaluki majambu gagampata mwanamundu ndaba jutenda kulwala, nanagu wannzibua ana na ana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:5">Nhwanu waka Yelobuamu pajwahika jilikopakia kuba mundu jongi. <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Lakini Ahiya pajunzowana jujingi pu ndwangu, japwaaga, “Kalibu nkati nhwanu uka Yelobuamu. Lakini mbona wilikopake kuba wa mundu jonge? Mina majambu gaguge nga gamboni kwaku! <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Gujenda ukupwagila bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu kubanga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, jupwaga ana, ‘Nuguhagwi wehapa pikilanda ja bandu, nu kuguhenga gubiya wa bambu nkolongu wa bandu bangu, Aizilaeli, <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />nugubalula ipandi ibeli ubambu ukolongu kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Daudi, nukugupeke wehapa. Lakini wehapa ngasegubii ngati ntumisi wangu Daudi, jojabiya jupwata malagalaki gangu, na jagahenga ganugapala kwa mwoju waki woti. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Wehapa guhengiki majambu mabaja ngani kupeta akabambu akolongu boti babugulonguli. Wehapa gunhengiki nguba ni inyela ndaba gulenganaki isapanga yengi ni imong'umong'u yukuhugati nu kuneka nepani. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Kwa ndaba ji lijambu heli isineta ling'ai kulukolu lwaka Yelobuamu, isinunkoma kila mwana mwanalomi jwa mwisu kubelekwa, jukubi ntumwa au jwanga kuba ntumwa mu lukolu lwaka Yelobuamu mu nndema uku Izilaeli. Naatinia bandu bulukolu lwaka Yelobohamu boti ngati mundu eatini takataka mbaka ihoba tikitiki. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Jokapi jojubii mu lukolu lwaka Yelobuamu jojwiiwelila ku musi, jimbwa yiitenda kunkula, na jokapi jojwiiwelila kumigonda, ijuni yukunani yiitenda kunkula. Nepani Bambu Sapanga ndi nembwagiki.’”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Ndienu Ahiya ampwagila nhwanu uka Yelobuamu, “Enu gujumuka, gujenda kunyumba jaku. Egwiihika pe ku musi, mwana waku jwiitenda kuwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Bandu boti buku Izilalei biitenda kundele malelu nukuntaga. Ndaba jombi pe kajika jaki ndi jobantaga, ndaba jwombi pee mu lukolu lwaka Yelobuamu jojuhengiki majambu gaganengane nepani Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Bambu Sapanga isijuhagula bambu nkolongu jongi jojwilongusa nndema uku Izilaeli jojaakomila ako bandu bi kibeleku saka Yelobuamu, hata henu lijambu heli litumbuli kupiti. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Eena, Bambu Sapanga jwaalapula bandu buku Izalaeli, nabombi biinyuka nyuka ngati manyai eganyuka panani ja masi kulosi. Jwammboa mu nndema wamboni gongo gojaapekia akahoku babu, nukumpesangana kutali, kwii ja losi luku Efulati ndaba munhengiki Bambu Sapanga jubiya ni inyela ndaba mulilenganaki imong'umongu ya Ashela, kisapanga sambomba. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Bambu Sapanga jaasoka Aizilaeli kwa ndaba ja mahakau gajahengiki Yelobuamu, na kwaahenga Azilaeli kabee ahenga mahakau.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Ndienu, nhwanu waka Yelobuamu jwatenda kuboka, jajenda mbaka ku musi uku Tiliza. Ejahika pe pundwingu mwana jatenda kuwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Bandu boti buku Izilaeli buntaga na batenda kundele ngati ejapwaga Bambu Sapanga, sukupete nndota jobunkema Ahiya, ntumisi waki.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelobuamu jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Mahengu gangi gaka bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu, na namuna ejakomana ngondu na namuna ejalongusa, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa ngombuke ya aka Bambu akolongu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yelobuamu jwalongusa kwa yaka ishilini ni mibeli, na jatenda kuwa, na mwana waki jobukema Nadabu jabia bambu nkolongu badala ja atati baki.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Lehobuamu juku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:5">2Majambu gi Ipindi 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 11:12-15">12-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Lehobuamu mwana waka Solomoni, jwabiya na yaka alubaini na moja pabunhimika kuba bambu nkolongu juku Yuda. Najombi jalongusa nndema uku Yuda yaka komi na saba, koni jubii ku musi uku Yelusalemu, musi goguwe Bambu Sapanga jwabia juguhagwi kuhuma mu makabila goti ga Aizilaeli bunndumbali homu. Amabu baki Lehobuamu babiya baakema Anaama kuhumi ku nndema uku Amoni.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Bandu buku Yuda bahenga majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Bunhenga jubiya ni inyela kwa ndaba ja mahakau gabu gabahengiki, mahakau gabu gabiya gingi kupeta gaahengiki akahoku babu. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Bililenganakia kabee pandu pukulumbali, ni minala jukupiiki matambiku ni imong'umong'u ya Ashela, kila panani jikitombi kilasu na kila pai ju nkongu gogubii na mahamba mabei. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Kabee kwabiya na akanalomi mu nndema uku Yuda babia agonalane beni kwa beni mu nndema ili kuilumbali imong'umong'u yabu, bandu bahenga majambu gukusukisa gababiya ahenga bandu banga Ayahudi babube Bambu Sapanga jabiya jaabengiki kabula Aizalaeli ngaseajingi mundema uku Kanani.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mu saka su nhwanu sukulongosa kwaki Lehobuamu, bambu nkolongu Shishaki juku Misili, jugulapula musi uku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />jwajukua kila sindu seabei mu kikoku sa Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, na yebiibei nnyumba jaka bambu nkolongu jajukua kila sindu, pamu na hindu yukukomane ngau yoti ya zahabu yejabiya julenganaki bambu nkolongu Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Lehobuamu jwalenganakia ngau ya shaba nakwaapeke alonda ba nnyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Kila kipindi bambu nkolongu pajujendika ku nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga, alonda atotula ngau heyi na mwenikatai atendika kuikelabu mu sumba su ulonda.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Mahengu gangi goti gaka bambu nkolongu Lehobuamu, gajagahengiki gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka bambu akolongu buku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Kambeli kambeli kwabiya na ngondu kati jaka bambu nkolongu Lehobuamu na bambu nkolongu Yelobuamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Najombi Lehobuamu jatenda kuwa na buntaga mu matenge ga akatati baki, mu musi waka Daudi. Amabu baki baakemika Naama kuhuma likabila la Amoni, na Abiya mwana waka Lehoboamu jabia bambu nkolongu badala jaki.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Abiya julongosa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2Majambu gi Ipindi 13:1-14:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Abiya jatumbulia kulongosa ku nndema uku Yuda mu saka sa komi na nani su kulongosa kwaka Yelobuamu, mwana waka Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Jalongusa ku Yuda yaka itatu koni jubii ku musi uku Yelusalemu. Amabaki baakemika Amaaka jojwababia mwana waka Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Abiya jahenga mahakau agalaga gabahenga atati mundu, wala ngasejwabii jukuhobaleka kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waki, ngati ebahenga ahoku baki Adaudi. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Pamu na haga, kwandaba jaka Daudi, Bambu Sapanga ampekia Abiya mwana, jojwiibiya bambu nkolongu pandu paki ku Musi uku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Bambu Sapanga jwahenga hela kwa ndaba Daudi jahengiki gaamboni palongi jaki na ngasejagakaniki malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga mu masoba gaki goti, ila pe majambu gaka Ulia, mundu juku Hiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kwabii na ngondu kati jaka Lehobuamu na Yelobuamu kipindi soti sukutama kwaka Abiya. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Mahengu gangi goti gaka Abiya gajagahengiki gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka Bambu Akolongu buku Yuda. Kwabiya na ngondu kati ja Abiya na Yelobuamu mu kutama kwabu.<verse eid="1KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Abiya jatenda kuwa na buntanga ku musi waka Daudi na mwana mundu jobukema Asa jwabia bambu nkolongu badala ja atati baki.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Asa julongosa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2Majambu gi Ipindi 15:16-16:6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mu saka si ishilini su ulongosi waka Yelobuamu, bambu juku Izilaeli, bambu nkolongu Asa jatumbulia kulongosa ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Jwalongusa kwa yaka alubaini na moja. Ambuja baki baakemika Amaaka bababi mwana waka Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Bambu Asa jahenga majambu gagajetakeka palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ngati ejahenga Daudi bababi ahoku baki. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Jaabenga mu nndema akanalomi baahenga ugoni sukugonalane beni na beni ili kuilumbali isapanga yabu, nukuiboa imong'umongu yela yebabiya akahoku baki biilenganaki. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Jwaaboa ambuja baki Maaka ulongosi wa kuba Malikia, ndaba balenganaki kimong'umong'u sa Ashela kisapanga sambomba, ndi Asa jukitunulana nu kukitiniya kimong'umong'u hesi mu ligomba la Kiduloni. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Lakini pandu panani pukupiiki matambiku isapanga ngasejupahalabini, hata hela jwombi jwabii na mwoju gukuhobaleka kwaka Bambu Sapanga mu kutama kwaki kwoti. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Jwiikelabua yombu yoti mu Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga yeyabiya ihimikwi na atati baki, pamu na yombu yaki mweni yela, yombu ya madini ga feza na yeilenganakiwi kwa madini ga zahabu na yombu yengi.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Bambu nkolongu Asa juku Yuda na bambu nkolongu Baasha juku Izilaeli, babiya mu ngondu kipindi soti mu ulongosi wabu. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baasha, bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli jugulapula nndema guku Yuda nu kutumbuli kusenga lumatu mu musi wa Lama, ili juwesa kumpengale mundu jokapi jwiiboka wala kujingi mu nndema goguwe Asa bambu nkolongu juku Yuda jwabiya julongosa, <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Asa jajukua madini ga feza na madini ga zahabu goti gagahigali mu kikoku sa Nyumba jaka Bambu Sapanga na mu nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. Jwiipia na jwaapekia akatumisi baki, jwaatuma ku Damasiko kwaka bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi jojabii mwana waka Tabilimoni, nsokoo waka Hezioni bambu nkolongu juku Silia, jojabiya julongosa ku Damasiko kupwaaga, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tujetangania wehapa na nepani ngati ebahenga atati bangu na atati baku, linga nuguleti madini ga feza na madini ga zahabu, na gukotuka kujetangana na bambu nkolongu Baasha juku Izilaeli, ili juboka munndema wango.” <verse eid="1KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ndienu Beni Hadadi jwilijetakia lilobi laka bambu nkolongu Asa, jwaatuma aka kilongosi baakomana ngondu baki, na akomana kondu baki kujenda kujilapu misi juku Izilaeli. Bugukamula musi wa Iyoni nuku Dani nuku Abeli Beti Maaka pandu papabii pambipi nu nhanga uku Galilaya nu nndema woti uku Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Bambu nkolongu Baasha ejajowana haga jwakotuka kugusenga musi uku Lama jakelubuka ku musi wa Tiliza.<verse eid="1KI 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Asa jwaalandila bandu boti buku Yuda, sanga kunndeka hata mundu jumu, ili bagaboa malibu goti ni imbau kuhuma ku musi wa Lama yeyabiya jutumii bambu nkolongu Baasha juku Izilaeli. Bambu nkolongu Asa jwiitumia hindu heyi kusenge musi wa Geba gogubii ku Benjamini na musi uku Mizipa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Majambu goti gajahengiki Asa mu ulongosi waki, kuwesa kwaki nu kusenga misi, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka Bambu Akolongu buku Yuda. Lakini mu kipindi sukusejeka kwaki, Asa jalwala ugonzu wa magolu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Ndienu Asa jwatenda kuwa, buntaga mu matenge gi kibambu mu musi waka Daudi najombi mwana waki Yehoshafati jabiya bambu nkolongu badala paki.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Nadabu juku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Mu saka sa pili su ulongosi waka Asa ku Yuda, Nadabu, mwana waka Yelobuamu, jwatumbulia kulongosa ku nndema uku Izilaeli. Najombi jwalongusa kwa yaka ibeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabu jahenga majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, ngati ebahenga atati baki babaahenga Aizilaeli ahenga mahakau.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwana waka Ahiya, julikabila la Isakali, ampangila majambu mabaja Nadabu. Kipindi Nadabu pajugujobalia musi uku Gibetoni gowabii wa Afilisiti, <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasha antukalia nu kunkoma Nadabu mu saka sa tatu su ubambu ukolongu waka Asa juku Yuda, najwombi Bahasha jwakuba bambu nkolongu badala jaki. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Ejatumbulia pe kulongosa, Baasha jaakoma bandu boti bu lukolu lwaka Yelobuamu, kulengana ni lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lejapwaga kupete ntumisi waki Ahiya ku musi uku Shilu. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Lijambu heli lahengika ndaba Yelobuamu jwahengiki mahakau gagahenga Aizilaeli ahenga mahakau. Lijambu heli luhenga Bambu Sapanga jubiya ninyela ngani.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Mahengu gangi goti gaka Nadabu na majambu gangi goti gajahengiki, gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka Bambu Akolongu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Bambu nkolongu Asa juku Yuda na bambu nkolongu Baasha juku Izilaeli babia na ngondu kipindi soti su ulongosi wabu.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baasha bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Mu saka sa tatu su ulongosi waka Asa bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, Baasha mwana waka Ahiya, jwatumbulia kulongosa ku Izilaeli kuhumi ku Tiliza. Jwalongusa kwa yaka ishilini nu nnsesi. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Baasha jatenda mahakau palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ngati agalaga gajahenga Yelobuamu, na kwaahenga bandu buku Izilaeli ahenga mahakau.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga luhikila Yehu mwana waka Hanani kunndongale Baasha lapwaga, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Wa Baasha wabia wamundu wanga kumanyikana, nuguhenga gubiya ukilongosi wa bandu bangu Aizilaeli. Wehapa gunzigiki Yelobuamu, waahengiki bandu bangu ahenga mahakau nukunhenga mia ni inyela kwa ndaba ja mahakau gabu. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Linga! Ngangabaki kugukoma wa Bahasha na bandu bumunnyumba jaku, ngati enaakoma bandu bu mu nyumba jaka Yelobuamu mwana waka Nabati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Mundu jokapi ju lukolu waku Baasha jojiwelila ku musi, jimbwa yiitenda kwa akula, na jokapi jojiwelila ku migonda ijuni yukunani itenda kunhonyo.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Mahengu gangi gaka Baasha nukuwesa kwaki, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka Bambu Akolongu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Ndienu Baasha jwatenda kuwa, buntaga ku Tiliza, mwanamundu jobunkema Ela jwalongusa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Kabee lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Baasha nu lukolu lwaki, kupete kuku nndota Yehu mwana waka Anani kwa ndaba ja mabaja gajahengiki palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Hela ndi Baasha anhenga Bambu Sapanga jubiya ni inyela kwa mahengu gaki, anziga Yelobuabu nu lukolu lwaki na kwaahenga bandu baki akomika boka tipitipi.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Ela juku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mu saka si ishilini na sita su ulongosi waka Asa bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, Ela mwana waka Baasha, jatumbulia kulongosa ku Izalaeli koni jubii ku Tiliza. Jwalongusa kwa yaka ibeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Zimuli jojabiya ntumisi waka Asa jojabia jujemale nusu ju nsambi wa magali gukuhutwa, ampangila kunhenge majambu mabaja. Lisoba limu, bambu nkolongu Ela ejabiya ku Tiliza kunyumba jaka Alisa jojabiya jujemale nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu, jakunywa nu kulobela. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Ndienu Zimuli jajingala nkati nu kunkoma. Ndienu jalongusa pandu paki. Hoku kwahengika saka si ishilini na saba su ulongosi waka Asa jojabii bambu nkolongu juku Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Ejatumbulia pe kulongosa, Zimuli jaakoma bandu boti bu lukolu lwaka Baasha, ngaseandekiki hata mwanalomi jumu ju lukolu lwaka Baasha, wala lukolu lwa akosi baki, <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Ndienu Zimuli jaakoma tipitipi bandu boti ba nyumba jaka Baasha kulengana ni lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lelunhikila kupete nndota Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Majambu haga gahengika kwa ndaba ja mahakau gajahengiki Baasha na mwanamundu Ela. Haba baahenga bandu buku Izilaeli ahenga mahakau su kuilumbali isapanga yabu, lihengu heli lunhenga Bambu Sapanga Sapanga jwa Izalaeli juyoma ngani. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Mahengu gangi gaka Ela gajahenga mu ulongosi waki, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke yaka Bambu Akolongu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Zimuli juku Izalaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Zimuli jatumbulia kulongosa ku Izalaeli, najwombi jalongusa masoba pee koni jubii ku Tiliza. Akomana ngondu babeka kambi musi uku Gibetoni gwa Afilisiti. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Akomana ngondu buku Izalaeli ebajowana kubanga bambu nkolongu Zimuli jupangiki majambu mabaja gukunkoma bambu nkolongu Ela, buntangasa Omili, jojabii nkolongu wa alonda babu, ili jubia bambu nkolongu jwa Izilaeli lisoba lelale pababii kukambi. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Bambu nkolongu Omili na akomana ngondu baki baboka ku musi uku Gibetoni, bajenda kugulapu musi uku Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Zimuli pajwabona kubanga musi woti atei kugukamu, jajingala nkati ja nyumba jiki bambu ukolongu, nu kujijosa mwotu, najwombi jawelila homu. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Lihengu heli lahengika kwa ndaba ja mahakau gajahengiki bambu nkolongu Zimuli, palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, nukunziga Yelobuamu jojahenga mahakau na kwaahenga bandu buku Izilaeli atenda mahakau. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Mahengu gangi gu ulongosi waka bambu nkolongu Zimuli ni mipangu jaki jukuhenga mabaja, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke ya aka Bambu Akolongu buku Izalaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Omili juku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Bandu buku Izilaeli, ndi babaganika makundi mabeli. Likundi limu lummanya Tibuni mwana waka Ginati kuba bambu nkolongu, ni likundi la pili lummanya Omili kuba bambu nkolongu wabu. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Lakini bandu babumpwata Omili baapeta makili bandu babumpwata Tibuni mwana waka Ginati, Tibuni jwatenda kuwa na Omili jabia bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Omili jwatumbulia kulongosa mu saka sa selasini na moja su ulongosi waka Asa jojabii bambu nkolongu juku Yuda. Jwalongusa kwa yaka komi ni ibeli, yaka sita jalongosa koni jubii ku Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Egapeta haga bambu nkolongu Omili jwikilomba kitombi sa Samalia kwiipandi elupu sita ya madini ga feza kuhuma kuka mundu jumu jobukema Shemeli, na jasenga musi panani jikitombi hesi. Musi hogu jugukema lihina Samalia kwa ndaba jaka Shemeli jojabiya mwinikitombi hoju pa mwandi.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Lakini bambu nkolongu Omili jahenga majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, jwahenga mabaja ngani kupeta akabambu akolongu boti babundonguli. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Ndienu bambu nkolongu Omili jahenga mahakau makolongu ngati ejahenga Yelobuamu mwana waka Nabati, joanhenga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, jubiya ni inyela sakwaahenga bandu buku Izalaeli ahenga mahakau sukuigungamali imong'umong'u yi isapanga yengi. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Mahengu gangi gaka Omili nukugangamala kwaki, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke ya aka Bambu Akolongu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Ndienu Omili jatenda kuwa, buntaga ku musi guku Samalia, mwanamundu joankema Ahabu jwabia bambu nkolongu pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izalaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mu saka sa selasini na nani su ulongosi waka Asa jojabii bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, Ahabu mwana waka Omili, jwatumbulia kulongosa ku Izilaeli. Jwalongusa ku musi uku Samalia kwa yaka ishilini ni mibeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabu mwana waka Omili jwahenga majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga kupeta aka bambu akolongu boti babundonguli. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Ngasekwatosiki pe kunnziga Yelobuamu mwana waka Nabati, kabee Ahabu anzukuwa Yezebeli kamwali waka Etibaali, jojabii bambu nkolongu jwa Asidoni, jatumbulia kutumaki nu kundumbali Baali. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Akisengila kisapanga Baali nyumba jukukilumbali ku Samalia, nu nkati jaki jalenganakia mesa jukupiiki matambiku. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Kabee bambu nkolongu Ahabu jalenganakia kimong'umong'u si kisapanga sa mbomba sebikikema Ashela, nukwaahenga bandu buku Izalaeli ahenga mahakau nu kunhenga Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Azilaeli jubiya ni inyela ngani. Ahabu jahenga majambu mabaja ngani kupeta aka bambu akolongu boti buku Izalaeli babundonguli. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Kipindi sukulongosa kwaki, Hieli jukuhuma ku musi uku Beseli jugusenga kabee musi uku Yeliku. Lakini pajwasenga pe nsingi wa musi uku Yeliku mwanawaki jukutumbuli joankema Abilamu jwatenda kuwa, kabee pajwalenganakia milyangu ja musi mwanawaki jwamwisu jobunkema jwatenda kuwa, haga gapitila kulengana ni lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga kupete Joshua.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Eliya jupwaga nga jikuni iyula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Ndienu Eliya mundu juku kijiji suku Tishibi gowabi ku Gileadi, ampwagila bambu nkolongu Ahabu, “Napa kwaka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Izilaeli jojubii mwomi na ndi nepani ndenda kuntumaki, kubanga ngakwiikubi nu ulumi wala ngajikuni iyula mbaka panipwaga kabee.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ndienu, lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Elia kupwaga, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Guboka pamba gujenda upandi golipiti lyoba, ukilihiya pa kalosi ka Kelisi kakabi upandi golipiti lyoba wa losi lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Hoku wikunywa masi ga mu kalosi haka nakabee nagalagalaki makongoo guguletila posu.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Ndienu, Eliya jajetakia lilagalaki laka Bambu Sapanga, jajenda kutama kukalosi ka Keliti kakabi upandi golipiti lyoba wa losi lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Makongoo gabia gundete mikati ni inyama, pulukela na pakamii, na jakunywa masi ga mu kalosi homu. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Lakini baada ja masoba masokopi kalosi kala katenda kujomale kwa ndaba ngasejakuniki iyula mu nndema.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elia anhyoa mwana juku mmbomba joawii alomi juku Seleputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ndienu, lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Eliya kupwaga, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Boka gujenda kumusi uku Seleputa, gogubii pambipi na musi uku Sidoni, gukatama koku. Nunndagalaki mmbomba jumu jojaweliwi nu ndomi waki jugupekia posu.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Ndienu, Eliya jatenda kuboka nukujenda ku Seleputa. Ejahika pilitanga la musi anketania mmbomba jumu jojakuwiki ndomi waki jutondo nhanzu. Elia ankema mmbomba jola nukumpwagi, “Nanuguloba gunetila masi ngunywaje.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Mmbomba jola pajwabiya jutenda kuboka, Eliya ankema kabee nukumpwagi, “Gupepa koku gunetila ni kipandi si libumunda.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Mmbomba jola ampwagila, “Nugulapi kwilihina laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waku jojubii mwomi, ngasemii ni libumunda hatalisikipi. Mii pe na mbunda jimu ju uwembi mu kibega na mahuta masikipi mu lisupa. Nhikiki pamba kutondo nhanzu, na nyenda kunyumba kujosa libumunda heli, ili tukula, kijomuka na tukuwa.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya ampwagila, “Wiijogopa. Jenda kahenga ngati egulongi. Lakini gunyosila nepani hoti kabumunda kasokopi gunetila, nahewijomula walijosila wa mweti na mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Kwa ndaba, Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jupwaga ana, ‘Uwembi goubii mu kibega saku nga gupungusike, wala mahuta gagabii mu lisupa ngagajomoki mbaka nepani Bambu Sapanga panajikunisa iyula mu nndema.’”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Ndienu, mmbomba jola jajenda kuhenga ngati Eliya ejabiya anndagalaki, ndi mmomba jola na akalongu baki na Eliya bapata posu kwa masoba gingi. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Uwembi mu kibega ngasewajomwiki, wala mahuta mu lisupa ngasegajomwiki ngati lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga leampwagila Eliya.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Egabiya gapetiki majambu haga, mwana jukumbomba jola jatenda kulwala, na jaendalia kulwala ngani, na mwisu we jatenda kuwa. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Mmbomba jola ampwagila Eliya, “Wamundu waka Sapanga ndaba jaki gunhengi hela? Boo, guhikiki pamba kungombuke mahakau gangu nukunhenga mwana wangu jukuwaje?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya ampwagila, “Netila mwana waku.” Ndienu Eliya anzukua mwana jola pikigamba sa anyongo baki, anzelula nukujenda naku mbaka ku nani ku sumba saki, angonika pi kitanda saki. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ndienu anndelila Bambu Sapanga koni jupwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, boo guletiki le ling'ai kuku mbomba jondama kwake, na jojundunza, gunndeti ling'ai sukunkoma mwanamundo?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Ndienu Eliya jiligonika panani jaka mwana hoju mala pa tatu nukunndele Bambu Sapanga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wangu, nuguloba gunkelubukia mwana jonzo womi waki!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Bambu Sapanga anzowania Eliya kulela kwaki, na mwana jola jatumbulia kupomo kabee.<verse eid="1KI 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya anhulua pai mwana jola na kwaapeke anyongo baki kuhuma kusumba sukunani, ampwagila, “Linga! Mwana waku jubii mwomi.”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Mmbomba hoju ampwagila Eliya, “Sajenu henu manyiki kubanga wehapa ndi wamundu waka Sapanga, na malobi gaka Bambu Sapanga gagahuma munndomu waku ga sakaka.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Eliya jupengana na alota bi kisapanga Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Egabia gapetiki masoba gingipi, mu saka sa tatu sanga kukuna iyula, Lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Eliya kupwaga, “Gujenda ukulilangia kwaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu, ni iyula jiikuna kabe pu nndema.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Ndienu, jwajenda kulilangi kwaka Ahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Kipindi hesi kwabii ni inzala ngamaa ku nndema uku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Ndi, Ahabu ankema Obadia jojabiya jojujemale nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu. Obadiya jwabiya mundu jojundumbali Bambu Sapanga ngani, <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />kipindi Yezebeli pajwabia jwaakoma alota baka Bambu Sapanga, Obadiya jwabiya jwaajukwi alota mia jimu jwaahiya hamusini hamusini mu makolu, jwabiya jwaapelake posu na masi. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ndienu Ahabu ampwagila Obadia, “Gujenda mu nndema woti motubii tulosi na mumagomba pangi tuwesa kupata manyoi nukuilea inyama yitu ili yiikuwa.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Ndienu, babagana pandu punndema lukujenda ili awesa kugupete nndema woti, Ahabu jwajenda upandi gongo na Obadia jwajenda upandi gongi.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadia pajwabiya mwiindela, jwaketangana na Eliya na paammanya, japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai nukupwaga, “Boo! Sakaka lee wehapa wa bambu wangu Eliya?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya anzibua! “Sakaka nepani Elia. Gujenda ukupwagila nkolongu waku kubanga nepani mi pani.”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadiya japwaga, “Nepani ngosi kike hata gupala kungabisi kwaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu ili jungomaje? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Nugulapi kwi lihina laka Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jojubii mwomi, nga bandu bu mu nndema hata gumu au ubambu ukolongu kokuje bambu nkolongu wangu ngasejuntumiki mundu kukutaputa. Kila kipindi bandu bunndema au ubambu pabapwaga kubanga ngasegubii hoku, Ahabu anhenga bambu nkolongu jwa hoku julapa kubanga ngase ammbwani. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Na sajenu, gupala nepani nyenda nukupwagila kubanga wehapa gubii pamba! <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Ngase manyi Loho waka Bambu Sapanga jwiamua kugupeleka kwako ana nugulekiki pamba. Anambiti kumpwagi Ahabu kubanga gubii pamba, ana ngajwaguketane jwiitenda kungoma nepani. Hata hela nepani ntumisi waku nu nndumbali Bambu Sapanga tumbuka mu ukombu wangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Boo, ngasegumanyi le kipindi Yezebeli ejabiya jwaakoma alota baka Bambu Sapanga, nepani naahiiki alota mia jimu, naabeka amusini amusini mu makolo mabeli, na nabiya naapelake posu na mase? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Nasajenu gupwaga nyenda nukumpwagila nkolongu wangu kubanga Eliya jubii pamba! Ahabu jwiitenda kungoma.”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya ampwagila, “Nugulapi kwilihina laka Bambu Sapanga jwaakomana ngondu, jojutama na jonuntumaki. Lelenu niipitila palongi jaka bambu nkolongu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Henu, Obadia jwajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu, nukumpwagi majambu haga. Najombi Ahabu jajenda kuketangana na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu eambona Eliya, japwaga, “Boo, wehapa ndi wewahenga bandu buku Izilaeli ang'alikaje?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya anzibua ana, “Jojaahenga bandu buku Izilaeli apata mang'aliku nga nepani ndeka, ila wehapa na bandu bu lukolu lwa atati baku. Mwanganya mugalekiki malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga nu kuilumbali isapanga Baali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Ndienu waakema bandu boti buku Izilaeli ahikaniya palongi jangu kukitombi suku Kalimeli. Nagwaaleta alota mia nnsesi na amusini bi isapanga Baali, na alota mia nnsesi bi kisapanga sa mbomba Ashela, baakula posu pa mesa jaka Malikia Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Ahabu jwaatuma bandu kunndema woti uku Izilaeli na kwaakema akalota boti bi kisapanga Baali kunani jikitombi suku Kalimeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Ndipala, Eliya jwaahegalia bandu boti nukwapwagi, “Mwiiendalia kuangajika mbaka lile? Ana Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga mupwata jwombi, lakini ana Baali ndi Sapanga, ndi mwapwata jwombi.” Lakini bandu ngase bunzibwiki lilobi lokapi. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Ndienu Eliya jwaapwagila bandu, “Nepani kajika jangu ndi nu nndota waka Bambu Sapanga nenhigali, lakini alota bi kisapanga Baali abii mia nu nsesi na amusini. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Henu nndeta makambaku ga ng'ombi ibeli, akalota ba Baali ahagula ng'ombi jimu, nu kujisinza, bijisekulana ipandi ipandi nu kujibeka panani ja hanzu, bila kupambaki mwotu. Nanepani isinyukuwa ng'ombi jengi heji, isinijisinza nu kujibeka panani ja hanzu bila kupambaki mwotu. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Ndienu, bombi bakiloba kisapanga sabu, na nepani nandoba Bambu Sapanga. Sapanga jojijibua sukupambaki mwotu, hoju ndi Sapanga jwa sakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Ndipala bandu boti bapwaga, “Enaa! Kubiya helahela.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Ndienu, Eliya jwaapwagila aka alota ba Baali, “Mwanganya ndi mwabingi, enu ndi ntumbulia. Mulihagulia likambaku limu la ng'ombi mujiandia nu kukiloba kisapanga sinu, lakini mwiipambaki mwotu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Akalota bala bahagula ng'ombi jabu, bijiandia, nukukiloba kisapanga Baali tumbuka pulukela mbaka lyoba mutu, bahomba homba nukujonga jonga kuyongalota pandu pukupiiki matambiku pababiya alenganaki koni ajamali sukupwaga, “Mwaa Baali, utujowaniaje!” Lakini ngasejapiti sauti jokapi, wala ngajojajibwiki.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Ekwahika saa sita lyoba mutu, Eliya jatumbulia kwaaheka koni jupwaga, “Nndoba kwa sauti ngolongu ngani! Jombi si ndi sapanga! Pengi jubii mu mawasu makolongu, au jubii na mahengu gingi, au jutei kuboka! Au le jutei kugonela, kupalika munzumuwaje!” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Aka alota haba bajamaliya ngani, bilisekulana kwi mipanga na kisu, ngati hebayobali, mbaka baholula mwai. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Baendalia kujamali nu kuhenga ngati bandu babi na mangongu mbaka pakamii. Lakini mbaka kipindi sukupiya litambiku, ngajojaajibwiki wala jojaalingalia.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Ndienu, Eliya jwaapwagila bandu, “Nhegalia pambipi na nepani.” Bombi batenda kuhegalela. Ndipala Eliya jasenga kabee mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku jejabi abombwi. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya jajukuwa malibu komi na mabeli, kulengana na mahina ga makabila ga Aizilaeli gagabiya baapeki bana baka Yakobu, jojuwe ndi lunhikila lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga kupwaga, “Kutumbuli lelenu lihina laku nagukema wa Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kwa malibu haga, Eliya ansengila Bambu Sapanga mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku, jwahemba nkoka kuyongalota mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku heji, nkoka goguwesa kujege ngati lita selasini ya masi. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Ndienu jwiipanga nhanzu sapi, jwasekulana ng'ombi jela ipandi ipandi, nu kuibeka panani ja nhanzu. Ndipala jwaapwagila bandu, “Ntwelakia masi mapipa nsesi nu kujiti panani jilitambiku lukutinii heli panani ja nhanzu.” Nabombi batenda hela. <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Ndienu jwaapwagila, “Nkelubukia kabee.” Nabombi bahenga helahe mala ja pili. Najombi jwaapwagila, “Nhenga hela kabee mala ja tatu.” Nabombi bahenga helahe. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Masi gasembalika pai kuyongalota mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku heji, mbaka gatwelala mu nkoka na gatenda kujitikana.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Ekwahika pakamii, kipindi sukupiya matambiku, nndota Eliya jwahegalia pa mesa ja malibu jukupiiki matambiku, andoba Bambu Sapanga kupwaga, “Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga waka Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobu, waalangiya bandu lelenu kubanga wehapa ndi Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli, nukubanga nepani ndi ntumisi waku nhengiki majambu haga kwa malagalaki gaku. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Gunyibua nepani, mwaa Bambu Sapanga, gunyibua ili bandu bamba amanya wehapa Bambu Sapanga ndi wa Sapanga, na wegung'anambu mioju jabu jugukelubukia wehapa.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Apalapa, mwotu waka Bambu Sapanga wahuluka kuhuma kunani nu kutini litambiku lela, na nhanzu na malibu nu luhombi nu kugajomalesa masi gumu nkoka goti. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Bandu boti ebagabona haga, bapega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai nu kupwaga, “Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga, Bambu Sapanga ndi Sapanga!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Ndienu Eliya Jwaapwagila bandu, “Mwaakamula akalota boti bikisapanga Baali. Mwandeka hata jumu wabu jutila!” Ndipala bandu baakamula boti, najombi Eliya jwaapelika pakalosi ka Kishoni, nakwaakoma hoku.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwisu gukutama sanga kukuna iyula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Baada ja majambu haga, Eliya ampwagila bambu nkolongu Ahabu, “Jenda kakula na ukakunywa, ndaba nukujowana kulundami kwiiyula.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Ndienu, Ahabu jwajenda kula na kunywa, najombi Eliya jwakwela kukitombi sa Kalimeli, na hoku japega magoti nukujinama mbaka pai nu kubeka pamiu jaki pikilanda ja magoti gaki. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Ndienu apwagila ntumisi waki, “Gujenda ukalingalia upandi guku nhanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Ntumisi jola jatenda kujenda, kulingali, najakelabuka kumpwagi, “Ngase kibii sindo.” Eliya ampwagila, “Gujenda kabee mbaka mala saba.” <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Mala ja saba, ntumisi jola jakelabuka nu kupwaga, “Nilibona lihundi lisoku ngati kiganza saka mundu kihuma ku nhanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Eliya ampwagila, “Jenda ukumpwagila bambu nkolongu Ahabu julihandia ligali laki lukuhutwa, juhelala ili iyula jampengalela.”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Esapeta kipindi kisokopi kunani kwatandagana mahundi gingi, na gwapoga nhwai, ndi jakuna iyula ngolongu. Najombi bambu nkolongu Ahabu jwakwela ligali laki lukuhutwa, jwabuja ku Yezeleli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Makili gaka Bambu Sapanga gunzingala Eliya, najombi julikasa, jwajombatika nu kundongule Ahabu kujingi ku musi uku Yezeleli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Eliya jutili ku kitombi sa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Bambu nkolongu Ahabu ansimulia nhwanu waki, Yezebeli, majambu goti gajahengiki Eliya namuna ejaakoma alota bikisapanga Baali ku upanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Ndienu, Yezebeli antuma mundu kuka Eliya ampwagila ana, “Nugulapi ana, kilabu kipindi ngati senze nibiya nugukomiki ngati wehapa ewaakoma alota haba, ana ngasenhengiki hela isapanga ingomila kutali.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya jajogopa ngamaa na jatila ili kulamisa womi waki, anzukua ntumisi waki nukujenda naku ku musi uku Beli Sheba ku Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:3">Najombi andeka ntumisi waki kokuje.<verse eid="1KI 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Najombi jajenda kwa sapwali ji lisoba limu kujingi kulungwenza. Ndienu jwahika, nukutama pu nkongu gumu, gobugukema nletemu. Hapa ndi jaloba kubanga jukuwa, koni jupwaga, “Kutosike! Nganhwesi kabeti. Mwaa Bambu Sapanga, nuguloba sajenu ugubowa womi wangu. Nepani nganamboni kupeta akahoku bangu.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ndienu, Eliya jagonila pai ju nkongu hogu, lunkamula lugonu. Kipindi aselase ntumisi waka Sapanga jukunani, jatenda kungusa nu kumpwagi, “Jumuka gukula.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Eliya ejajumuka jalinga koni na koni, pambipi ni kimutu saki kwabii ni libumunda leajosiki kwa makalakala, na supa sa masi pambipi ni kimutu saki. Ndienu jakula, nakunywa, jwagonila kabee. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ntumisi waka Sapanga jukunani anhikila kabee mala ja pili, angusa nukumpwagi, “Jumuka gukula anangahela sapwali jaku jitenda kunonopa ngani.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Eliya jajumuka, jakula na kunywa. Ndienu jajenda kwa makili ga posu heji sapwali ja masoba alubaini, muwi ni ikilu, mbaka ku Holebu yani Sinai, kitombi saka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Hoku, jahika pandu palabi likolu jatama homu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Ndi lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila kupwaga, “Eliya guhenga kii pambane?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Najombi japwaaga, “Moniki wipu, mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga jwa akomana ngondu. Aizilaeli bilikaniki lilaganu laku, bapabombulini mesa yaka yukupiiki matambiku na kwaakoma alota baku ku upanga. Ndi nepani pe nenhigali, nakabee andaputa ili angoma!”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Pita kunza wakajema panani ji kitombi palongi jangu Bambu Sapanga.” Ndienu hapa kimbonga kikolongu sahika nukukajulana itombi palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. Lakini Bambu Sapanga ngase jabii mu kimbonga hesi. Pasapeta kimbonga hesi, sahika kililima, lakini Bambu Sapanga ngase jwabii mu kililima hesi. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Esapeta kililima wahika mwotu kabee. Lakini Bambu Sapanga ngase jwabii mu mwotu hogu. Ewapeta mwotu hogu, ndi kahika kasauti kasoku kukubole.<verse eid="1KI 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Ndienu, Eliya pajwajowana sauti jukubole heji, jwilihekalia pa mihu jaki kwi ingobu jaki, jwapita nukujema kunza ji likolu. Hapa ndi jijijowania sauti jakapwaga, “Eliya! Guhenga kii paniapa?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Najombi anzibua, “Moniki wipu, mwaa Bambu Sapanga, Sapanga wa akomana ngondu kwa ndaba bandu buku Izilaeli bilikaniki lilaganu laku, bapabombulini mesa yaku yukupiiki matambiku na kwaakoma alota baku ku upanga, ndi nepani pena nehigali, nakabee andaputa ili angoma!”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, “Gukelubuka sukupete indela jukulukoba mbaka ku Damasiko. Pawihika hoku, wannzakania mahuta Azaeli ili jubiya bambu nkolongu juku Silia. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Najombi Yehu, mwana waka Nimushi, wannzakania mahuta ili jubiya bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli. Elisha mwana waka Shafati, juku Abeli Mehola, wannzakania mahuta jubiya nndota pandu paku. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Ndienu jokapi jojilemangana upanga waka Azaeli, Yehu jitenda kunkoma, na jokapi jojilemangana upanga waka Yehu, Elisha jitenda kunkoma. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Hata sajenu mii na bandu elupu saba mu nndema uku Izilaeli, boti babube ngasebunndumbali kisapanga Baali, na boti babube ngasebikihenge isima kimong'umong'u hesi.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha ankema kuba nndota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Eliya jaboka nu kunkole Elisha, mwana waka Shafati jutenda kulema. Jabiya julema kwa ng'ombi pea komi ni ibeli yeyabiya itenda kulema, na pea ja ng'ombi yaka Elisha jabiya munyuma ngani. Ndienu Eliya jwahula kanzu jaki nukunhwatika Elisha. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Ndipala, Elisha jwiileka ng'ombi yaki, ampwata Eliya imbelu nukumpwagi, “Guneka hoti nyenda nakaatabuka atati bangu na amabangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Eliya anzibua, “Gujendaje! Ndaba ngase nugukanike.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Ndienu, Elisha anndeka Eliya, nukuikelabu ng'ombi yaki, jwiisinza ng'ombi heyi nukuiteleka sukutumi hanzu yi ingolingoli, jaapekia bandu, batenda kula najombi jatenda kuboka, nukumpwata Eliya kojabiya ntumisi waki.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Asilia na Aizilaeli atenda kukomana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Beni Hadadi bambu nkolongu juku Silia, jwaakusanya akomana ngondu baki boti, jajongana na akabambu akolongu bangi selasini na abeli babahika na falasi na magali gu kuhutwa. Bugujendila musi uku Samalia bugujobalia nu kugutukali. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Ndienu, jatuma bandu ku musi kwaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izilaeli, bumpwagila ana, “Bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi jupwaga ana, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />Madini gaku ga feza na madini gaku ga zahabu ndi mali gaku na akahanu baku baanyambiki na bana baku ndi baki.”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Najombi bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli jajibua, “Wabambu wangu segupwagiki ndi sa sakaka, nepani na hindu yoti yemii nayu ndi mali gaki.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Ndienu, bandu bala bunkelabukia kabee bambu nkolongu Ahabu, nu kumpwagila, “Nkolongu Beni Hadadi jupwaga kubanga, nugutumila bandu ili gumbekia madini ga feza na madini ga zahabu na akahanu baku pamu na bana bako. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Ndienu, kilabu kipindi ngati senze, naatuma atumisi bangu kulikagu lijumba laku likibambu na nyumba ya atumisi baku, atola kila sindu sewikipai ngani.”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Ndipala, Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, jwaakema akakilongosi boti bu nndema, jwaapwagila, “Henu nndinga mundu ajo mwojututumbuli ngondu! Jaatumiki bandu kwangune kubanga jupala akahanu bangu, na bana bangu na madini ga zahabu gangu na madini ga feza gangu. Nepani ngasenukanila!”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Aseja na bandu boti bumpwagila, “Wiihola wala wanzetake.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Ndienu, Ahabu jaapwagila bandu baka bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi, “Mumpwagila bambu wangu nkolongu ana, ‘Nepani nu ntumisi waku nhwesa kuhenga goti gaugapalika pa mwandi, lakini malagalaki ga pili gani nganyetake hata kulenga.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:9">Ndipala bandu bala babokaniya kujenda kupeleka majambu bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Beni Hadadi antumila Ahabu bandu kumpwagi, “Isapanga inapula ngamaa, ana nganaguhalabani musi uku Samalia na ngasiihigali sindu sokapi sesuse hata akomana ngondu baku ngabiwesi kukijuku kuba ngombuke!”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izilaeli jajibua kubanga, “Mumpwagila bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi mundu jojujenda kukomana ngondu ngasejikipuna, jikipuna baada jukuwesa ku ngondu!”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Beni Hadadi jagajoanya majambu haga gaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu, kipindi jombi na akabambu akolongu bangi bababiya ajongini naku pababiya abii mu mahema gabu atenda kunywa. Ndienu jwalagalakia akoma ngondu baki, “Mliandia kujenda kukomana ngondu.” Ndienu biliandia kujenda kukomana ku Samalia.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Kipindi sese, nndota jumu anzendila bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izilaeli, ampwagila ana, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaga kubanga, ‘Boo, waabweni akomana ngondu haba heajolwike? Lelenu isinaahenga asindwa palongi jaku, nanagu wiimanya kubanga nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Najombi Ahabu jalalukia, “Jwinyangatia nyane?” Nndota japwaaga, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Bagujangatia akaakombu baakomana ngondu babaatumaki akolongu ba musi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Najombi bambu nkolongu jalalukia, “Nyane jojitumbulia kukomana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Nndota anzibua, “Ndi wehapa!”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Ndipala, bambu nkolongu Ahabu jaakema akakilongosi baakomana ngondu bababi bu nkoa, babia akanalomi mia mbili selasini na mbili. Ndienu jwaakusanya Aizilaeli boti babaigali jumula jabu babia elupu saba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Ndienu, pakwaika lyobamutu Ahabu na akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli batenda kuboka, kipindi hesi Beni Hadadi na aka bambu akolongu ajaki selasini na abeli bababiya jujongini naku bababia aendale kunywa nu kulobe mu mahema gabu. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Aka akombu bababia akilongosi baakomana ngondu bababi bi mikoa, batenda kulongule. Kipindi hesi bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi jwabiya jaatumiki bandu baalaluki majambu babube bahika na kwaapwagi kubanga, akomana ngondu ahika kuhuma ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Beni Hadadi jaalagalakiya, “Mwaakamula koni abii bomi. Ana ahikiki ku lukwali mwaakamula koni abii bomi na hata anahiki kwa ndaba ja ngondu mwaakamula koni abii bomi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Ndienu, akombu bababia akakilongosi baakomana ngondu bu nkoa, bapita kunza ja musi koni akomana ngondu abii kunnyuma. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Kila jumu wabu ankoma mmbaja wabu jumu. Bandu buku Silia batila imbelu, na akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli batenda kwaabenga, lakini Beni Hadadi bambu nkolongu juku Silia, koni jukwei falasi, jwatila na akomana ngondu asokopi baakwei falasi. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Ndipala bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli jwawesa ngondu, jwiikamula falasi pamu na magali gukuhutwa gingi, na kwaakoma bandu bingi buku Silia.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Mwenikatai, nndota jola jajenda kwaka bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, ampwagila kubanga, “Wiliandia nu guholalia samboni sukuhenga. Pa mwaka bambu nkolongu juku Silia jwiihika kukomana na wehapa kabeti.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu buku Silia akomana kabe na bandu buku Aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Aka kilongosi bababia pai jaka ba bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi balongila majambu ganga, “Isapanga ya bandu buku Izilaeli ndi isapanga yu muitombi, ndi maana babia na makili gukutuwesa lakini anatukomini nabu punndema uku ubambaa sakaka twiitenda kwaawesa. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Ndienu guhenga ana, waaboa aka bambu akolongu selasini na abeli haba pandu pabu, waabeka akakilongosi bangi ba akomana ngondu badala jabu. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Waandia akomana ngondu bingi abia ngati bababi pa mwandi, kelubukia falasi yeyaobiki na magali gukuhutwa ngati gaugahoa pa mwandi. Hapa ndi patwiiwesa kukomana na Aizilaeli pandu puubamba natwepani twiibia na makili kupeta bombi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Beni Hadadi jagajowania majambu gabu, na jahenga ahelahela.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Saka sesapwata esapeta kipindi sikipepu, bambu nkolongu Beni Hadadi jwaakusanya akomana ngondu baki, jwajenda ku musi uku Afeki kukomana na bandu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Nabombi akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli bakusanywa na kwaapeke hindu yukukomane, bajenda kukomana na bandu buku Silia. Bandu buku Izilaeli bajenda kubeka kambi, ngati makundi masoku masoku mabeli gi imbui, lakini bandu buku Silia babiya ajagani munndema mwoti.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Ndipala, mundu waka Sapanga anzendila bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, nu kumpwagi, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Kwa ndaba bandu buku Silia apwagiki kubanga nepani Bambu Sapanga ndi na Sapanga ju muitombi wala nga Sapanga wa pandu pu ubamba. Nuguhenga waawesa bandu haba bingi, na wehapa isigumanya kubanga nepani ndi Bambu Sapanga.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli na bandu buku Silia bapega kambi masoba saba, koni alingalani. Lisoba la saba ngondu jatenda kutumbuli. Lisoba lela akomana ngondu buku Izilaeli baakoma akomana ngondu baajenda kwa magolu laki jimu. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Babahigalia batilila ku musi uku Afeki. Hoku lumatu lwa musi lwatenda kwahabuki na kwaakoma akomana ngondu buku Silia elupu ishilini na saba bababia ahigali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:30">Beni Hadadi jatila nu kulijoba mu sumba su nkati sa nyumba jejabii pikilanda ja musi. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Atumisi baki bumpwata nu kumpwagi, “Tujowini kubanga akabambu akolongu buku Izilaeli abii ni ikia. Ndienu, gutuleka tulikonga maguni mu ibunu ni migoji nhingu, na tujenda kwaka bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli. Pengi kwa juwesa kuguleka wa mwomi.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Ndienu, bilikonga maguni mwiibunu yabu ni migoji nhingu yabu, nukunzende bambu nkolongu juku Izalaeli, bumpwagila, “Ntumisi waku Beni hadadi, juguloba ana, ‘Gupepa koku nuguloba guneka namwomi.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Ahabu japwaga, Kumbi jakali mwomi? Sapi pena, jwombi ndi nndongu wango.<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Atumisi baka Beni Hadadi babona kuba jenieji nginyuli ja mboni, ndienu apalapa bumpwagi, “Enaa sakaka Beni Hadadi ndi nndongu waku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Ahabu jaapwagila, “Nzenda mukundeta kwangu nepani.” Ndienu, Beni Hadadi pabunndeta, Ahabu ankwelisa Beni Hadadi mu ligali laki lukuhutwa na falasi. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ndienu, Beni Hadadi ampwagila, “Misi joti jebabiya atati bangu baajopiki atati baku, nitenda kugukelubuki. Guwesa kupungu guliu lukulombesa hindu ku Damasiko hoku ngati eahengiki atati bangu ku musi uku Samalia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ahabu anzibua, “Isinugulekakia kwi mihilu heji.” Ndipala jajongana naku nu kundekakela.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nndota andapi mbamba Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Kupete lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga, jumu ja anapunzi buku nndota, ampwagila nnzaki, “Gupepa koku, gunapula na hindu yaku yukukomane.” Lakini nnzaki jakana kunndapu. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Najombi ampwagila, “Kwa ndaba gukaniki kujetake malagalaki gaka Bambu Sapanga, esigulekana pe nanepani lihimba isilitenda kugukoma.” Na sakaka, apalapa ejalekana pe na jwombi, jwaketangana ni lihimba latenda kunkoma.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Ndienu, mwanapunzi hoju anketania mundu jongi, ampwagila ana, “Gupepa koku gunapula.” Mundu hoju andapula mbaka kunhumisa. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Ndipala, nndota jatenda kuboka, jwajenda kutama pulutengu ji indela, ili kundendale bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, koni jilikongiki libanga laki ni pamiu kwi kitambaa ili jimanyikana. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Ahabu pajwabiya jutenda kupeta, nndota annkema su kupwaga, “Mwaa bambu nepani nuntumisi waku nabii pu nsitali ukulongo ku ngondu, jahika nkomana ngondu jumu, janetila mundu jumu jobunkamwi nu kumpwagi, ‘Guntunza mundu jonzo anajutii gwiilepa womi waki kwa womi waku au wiilepa ipandi elupu itatu ya madini ga feza.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Lakini panabiya na mahengu gangi, mundu hoju jatenda kutila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli apwagila, “Ndi ekwibiya kutemuliwa kwaku, gulitemwi wamwete.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Hapa ndi nndota jikiboa kitambaa pamihu jaki kanyata kanyata, na bambu nkolongu jammanya kubanga ndi jumu ja alota. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Ndienu, nndota ampwagila bambu nkolongu, “Bambu Sapanga jupwaga anana, ‘Kwa ndaba gundekaki jugulema mundu jonugupwagi kunkoma, ndienu isigulepa womi waki kwa womi waku, na bandu baki kwa ndaba bandu baku.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Ndipala, bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli jajenda kunyumba jaki ku Samalia, koni mmwoju jaki jusukii ni inyela ngamaa.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Lituhi li mizabibu laka Naboti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Naboti, mwenei juku musi wa Yezeleli, jwabiya ni lituhi laki li mizabibu ku Yezeleli, pambipi na nyumba jaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu, bambu nkolongu juku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ndienu, lisoba limu, Ahabu ampwagila Naboti, “Gumbekia lituhi laku li mizabibu ili nilihenga kuba lituhi lukulema likolu, ndaba libii pambipi na nyumba jangu. Nagupekia lituhi lengi la amboni ngani, au ana ngasegupai isinugulepa hela ngati egupala kulengana nu ukolongu waki.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Lakini, Naboti anzibua Ahabu, “Bambu Sapanga jumokia kutali lijambu laki lukugupeke wehapa ulisi gonugupata kwa akatati bangu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Ndipala Ahabu jaboka nukujenda kunyumba jaki koni gummbina moju ni inyela ngamaa, kwa ndaba ja majambu gajapwaga Naboti, mwenei juku Yezeleli, ampwagila kubanga, “Nganagupeke kumpee ulisi gonapata kwa atati bangu.” Ndienu, jagonila pikitanda, koni jung'ong'oteka nu kukana kula posu.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Lakini Yezebeli, nhwanu waka Ahabu, anzendila nu kunndaluki, “Mbona gusukii ngamaa nu gukana kula poso?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Najombi Ahabu ampwagila, “Kwa ndaba nakalongi na Naboti, mwenei juku Yezeleli, numpwagila junombasia lituhi laki li mizabibu, au ana jupai numpekia lituhi lengi badala ja heli. Lakini jombi jambwagila, ‘Nganugupeke lituhi langu li mizabibu.’”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Ndipala, Yezebeli, nhwanu waki ampwagila, “Boo jojulongosa ku nndema uku Izilaeli ndi nyane? Boo nga lee wenga? Jumuka gukula gutulia nu kutogule, nepani kajika jangu isinugupekia lituhi li mizabibu laka Naboti, mwenei juku Yezeleli.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Ndienu, Yezebeli jaandika balua isokopi kwi lihina laka bambu nkolongu Ahabu nu kuipotale mihuli jiki bambu nkolongu. Nu kujiipelaka balua heyi kwa aseja na bandu baamanyakini bababia atama na Naboti ku Yezeleli hoku. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Balua yee jaandiki ana, “Mwaalagalakia bandu apanga lisoba lukupunga kula posu, nketangana na muntamika Naboti pandu pi isima pikilanda ja bandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Ndienu mwaataputa bandu abaja abeli bakatama sukulingalani na jombi nu kuntaki sukupwaga, ‘Wehapa gunndapi mbamba Sapanga na bambu nkolongu.’ Ndienu mwampiya kunza, mukunkoma su kundapu malibu!”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Ndienu, bababiya atama na Naboti, aseja na bandu baamanyakini ba musi uku Yezeleli, bahenga ngati ejalagalakia Yezebeli mu balua jaki. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Ndienu batangasa lisoba lu kupunga kula posu, nu kumbeka Naboti pandu papabi ni isima pikilanda ja bandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ndienu, bandu abeli abaja babaandii bala batama ili kuntaki Naboti palongi ja bandu, bapwaaga, “Naboti andapi mbamba Bambu Sapanga na bambu nkolongu, ndienu Naboti ampia kunza nukunndapu malibu.” <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ndienu, jaatuma bandu kumpwagi Yezebeli kubanga Naboti ankomiki su kundapu malibu.<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yezebeli ebumpwagila kubanga Naboti atei kunkoma su kunndapu malibu, ampwagila Ahabu, “Gujumuka! Gujenda ku lituhi li mizabibu laka Naboti, jojabi mundu juku Yezeleli, lejabiya jukaniki kukulombasela. Naboti ngasejubii mwomi kabete anndapu malibu mbaka kuwa.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Apalapa Ahabu ejajowana pe kubanga Naboti jutei kuwa, jajumuka nu kujenda ku lihenga lituhi laka Naboti libiya laki.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ndienu, lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga luhikila nndota Eliya jojabia jutama ku Tishibe kubanga, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Guboka gujenda ukaketangana na Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, jojuwe jujulongosa koni jubii ku Samalia. Wanketania mu lituhi li mizabibu laka Naboti, julijukwi nu kulihenga libia laki. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Wampwagila, Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Gunkomiki nu kujuku litui nu kulihenga libiya lako?’ Kabee Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Pandu pala payalamba jimbwa mwai waka Naboti, ndi pailamba jimbwa mwai waku.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ahabu paambona Eliya, japwaaga, “Wehapa gumbaja wangu, henu gungamwile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliya anzibua, “Enaa! Nugukamwi, kwa ndaba wehepa gupala ngani kuhenga mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana, ‘Kyekye kololoo! Kupalika nugukoma tipitipi. Naakoma bandu bi kibeleku saku soti kila mwanalomi nu mmbomba mu kibeleku saku mu nndema uku Izilaeli jukubi ntumwa au jwanga ntumwa. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Alongu baku naahenga ngati alongu baka Yelobuamu mwana waka Nabati, na ngati Baasha mwana waka Ahiya, kwa ndaba gujihengiki inyela jangu jikwela ngani na kwaahenga bandu buku Izilaeli ahenga mahakau.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Kabee Bambu Sapanga jupwaga ana kwa ndaba jaka Yezebeli, ‘Jimbwa yagukula ntuhi waka Yezebeli pambipi nu lumatu lwa musi guku Yezeleli. <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Enaa, mundu jokapi jwikibeleku saka Ahabu jojiwelila ku musi, jimbwa yiitenda kunkula, na jokapi jojiwelila ku migonda, ijuni yukunani yiitenda kunkula.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Nga mundu jokapi jojupala kuhenga mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga ngati Ahabu, nhwanu waki Yezebeli ndi joankolua kuhenga hela. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Jahenga majambu gukusukisa su kuilumbali imong'umong'u yi isapanga ngati ebabiya ahenga bandu buku Amoli babube pa mwandi Bambu Sapanga jaabenga palongi ja bandu buku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Lakini, Ahabu ejajowana malobi haga, jwajendulana ingobu yaki, jwawata maguni kanzika, jwapunga kula posu, jwabiya jugone na maguni nu kujenda jenda ako na ako koni su usungu.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Ndienu, lilobi lende laka Bambu Sapanga lunhikila Eliya mundu juku musi uku Tishibe kubanga, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Gubweni namuna Ahabu hejulihulwi palongi jangu? Ndienu kwa ndaba jutei kulihele nganaakomi alongu baki koni jubii mwomi, lakini mu kipindi su ulongosi waka mwana mundu ndi naakoma bandu bi kibeleku saki Ahabu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Nndota Mikaya andakali Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2Majambu gi Ipindi 18:2-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Kwi kipindi sa yaka itatu helahe, bandu batama sulukwali mu nndema uku Izilaeli nu nndema uku Silia. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Lakini mu saka sa tatu, Yehoshafati bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, jajenda kuntembale Ahabu, bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ahabu jabiya jaapwagi aka kilongosi ba pai jaki, “Boo, ngasemmanyiki kubanga musi uku Lamoti Gileadi ndi mali gito? Mbona tutamani pena sanga kujenda kugujopa kuka bambu nkolongu juku Silia?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Ndienu anndalukiya Yehoshafati, “Boo isigujenda pamu na nepani kukomana ku musi uku Lamoti Gileade?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Najombi Yehoshafati anzibua bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, “Enaa, nepani na wehepa ndi tubii sindu simwa, ndienu nyetaki akomana ngondu bangu na falasi yangu kujenda kukomana nabu.”<verse eid="1KI 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Lakini Yehoshafati kabe ampwagila bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli ana, “Tutumbuliya oti kundaluki Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Ndienu, Ahabu jaakema alota mia nsesi, jwalalukia, “Boo nyenda kukomana na bandu buku Lamoti Gileadi, amale niijenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Bombi bunzibua, “Gujenda, Bambu Sapanga jwaguhenga wawesa.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Lakini Yehoshafati jalalukiya kabee, “Bolee pamba ngase jubii kabe nndota jongi jwaka Bambu Sapanga jotuwesa kundalukia sindo?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Najombi Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli anzibua Yehoshafati, “Jwakoli jumwa, jobukema Mikaya mwana waka Imula. Jwombi tuwesa kundaluki majambu gaka Bambu Sapanga. Lakini jwombi nepani nunsuki ngamaa kwa ndaba jombi ngasejunote majambu gaambone ila pe mabaja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehoshafati ampwagila, “Ngasapi wabambu nkolongu kulonge ana.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Ndienu Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, ankema ntumisi jumu, nu kundagalaki, “Kanyata gujenda ukukema Mikaya mwana waka Imula.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Kipindi hesi, bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli pamu na Yehoshafati bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, babiya atemi mwi iteu yabu yu ulongosi pandu pukupete ilebi mu litanga lukujingali ku musi uku Samalia, kipindi hesi alota boti abiya apia ulota palongi jabu. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Kati ja alota haba kwabii nu nndo jobunkema Sedekia mwana waka Kenaana, hoju jwabia julenganaki manyelu gi kisomasoma nu kupwaga Ahabu, “Bambu Sapanga julonge kubanga, ‘Kwa manyelu ganga, waakelabua mu nyuma bandu buku Silia na kwaakoma.’” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Hata alota bangi bala boti babia apia ulota ahelahe bapwaga, “Jenda kakomana na bandu buku Lamoti Gileadi, wiitenda kwaawesa! Bambu Sapanga jwagupekia makili gakawesa.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Kipindi ntumisi jola jobabiya buntumiki kuka nndota jobukema Mikaya, ampwagila ana, “Akalota boti, bumpiikia ulota bambu nkolongu kubanga jwiitenda kuwesa, henu gupepa koku na wehapa gundondulia ngati bombi ebundonduli, gundondulia ngamboni.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Lakini nndota Mikaya jajibua, “Napa ku lihina laka Bambu Sapanga jojubii mwomi, nepani isimbwaga pe gasijumbwagila Bambu Sapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Ndienu nndota Mikaya ejahika palongi jaka bambu nkolongu, bambu nkolongu andalukia, “Tujenda le kukomana ngondu ku musi uku Lamoti Gileade amale twiijendaa?” Najombi anzibua, “Gujenda na ukatenda kwaawesa, najombi Bambu Sapanga jwagubeka musi hogu pai ju ulongosi waku.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Lakini bambu nkolongu ampwagila, “Nagulapisa mala palenga ku liina laka Bambu Sapanga ili manya gagulote haga ga sakaka?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Ndienu, Mikaya anzibua, “Naabona akomana ngondu boti buku Izilaeli apesangina mwi itombi ngati makondoo ganga na alimi. Najombi Bambu Sapanga japwaaga, ‘Akomana ngondu haba ngase abi ni kilongose, ndienu kila mundu jubuja kunyumba jaki su lukwali.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Ndipala Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli ampwagila Yehoshafati, “Ngasenukugupwagi kubanga nndota ajo ngajumbiiki ulota gambone ila pe majambu mabaja kwangu nepane?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Mikaya jaendaliya kupwaaga, “Gujowania lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga. Numbona Bambu Sapanga jutemi pikiteu saki su ulongosi, na akomana ngondu boti bukunani ajemiki pulutengu jaki, upandi ukumalele nu upandi wa mangega. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Bambu Sapanga jaalaluki, ‘Boo, nya jojuwesa kunkolo Ahabu jujenda kugulapu musi uku Lamoti Gileadi na jakakuwila koko?’ Kila jumu jajibua ngati ejabiya juholali, <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />ndienu kilombu simu esapitila palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, sapwaga, ‘Nepani mbaka nankolo.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Bambu Sapanga andalukia, ‘Kwiindela bole?’ Najombi jajibua, ‘Niijenda nakwaahenga alota baki boti apwaga isoli.’ Bambu Sapanga ampwagila, ‘Wehapa guwesa kunkoloo, henu gujenda uka henga helahe.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Ndienu, Mikaya jaendaliya kupwaaga, ‘Linga Bambu Sapanga jwaahengiki akaalota baku boti apwaga isoli. Bambu Sapanga julagalaki wiipata mabaja!’”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Ndienu, nndota Sedekia mwana waka Kenani, anhegalia Mikaya, angomba kopi mulutuku nu kundaluki ana, “Tumbuka lii Loho jaka Bambu Sapanga janeka nepani, nu kuhika kulonge na wehapa?” <verse eid="1KI 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya anzibua, “Lisoba lewijingala mu sumba su nkati nu kulihia, ndi pawimanya.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Najwombi bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izilaeli japwaga, “Munkamula Mikaya, munkelubua kwaka Amoni, nkolongu jwa musi kwaka Yoashi mwana waka bambu nkolongu. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Mukumpwagila bunzingia mu ligelesa nu kumpeke libumunda lisokopi na masi, mbaka panibuja na mwomi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ndipala Mikaya japwaaga, “Ana gubujiki wa mwomi ndi paniimanya Bambu Sapanga ngase jwalongi na nepani.” Ndienu jaendalia kulonge, “Mwaa bandu boti nkombuka malobi haga gambwagiki!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu jutenda kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2Majambu gi Ipindi 18:28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Ndienu, bambu nkolongu Ahabu juku Izilaeli jajenda pamu na bambu nkolongu Yehoshafati juku Yuda, kugulapu musi uku Lamoti Gileadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Ahabu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli ampwagila Yehoshafati ana, “Kungondu hoku nepani niitenda kujoba nganiwati ingobu ya ikibambu lakini wehapa gunhwata ingobu yaku ikibambu.” Ndienu bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli jajenda sanga kuwata ingobu yaki yikibambu ili kujoba jiimanyikana.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Bambu nkolongu juku Silia jwabiya jaalagalaki akalonda baki selasini na abeli bababiya ajemale magali gaki gukuhutwa, japwaaga, “Mwiikomana na mundu jokapi jola, jukubi nkolongu au nsoku, ila pe bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Ndienu munikatai jaki aka kilongosi ba akaakomana ngondu bala bumbona Yehoshafati, bapwaaga, “Sakaka jonzo ndi bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.” Ndienu, batenda kumpwata, nu kupala kukomana naku lakini Yehoshafati jatenda kujamali. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Aka kilongosi ba akaakomana ngondu ba magali gukuhutwa bala pabamanya kubanga hoju nga bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli bakotuka kunndapu na bakotuka kumpwata. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Lakini, nkomana ngondu jumwa juku Silia, jwahuta lupende lwaki sukubahitisa, gunhosa nkoa bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli pikigamba, pandu papalombikini ingobu jaki jiki somasoma. Ahabu ampwagila jojabiya juendesa ligali laki, “Ng'anambua ligali na gumowa pa ngondu, ndaba anhumisi ngamaa!”<verse eid="1KI 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Na ngondu lisoba lela jaendalia kubaba ngani, koni bambu nkolongu bungoniki mu ligali, kulangi bandu buku Silia. Mwai gwatenda kumpita pi kilonda saki nu kunyika mbaka pai ji ligali, ekwahika pakamii, jwatenda kuwa. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Lyoba palabiya litenda kujingila, balagalakia ana pababiya ku likambi, “Kila mundu jubuja ku musi waki nuku nndema waki!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Bambu nkolongu Ahabu pajakuwa ntuhi waki bugupelaka ku musi uku Samalia na bugutaga hoku. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Baada jaka bambu nkolongu kuwa biligolula ligali laki lukuhutwa ku litanda luku Samalia, momuje akambomba agoni bahoga mola, na jimbwa yalamba mwai waki ngati lilobi laka Bambu Sapanga elipwaaga.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Mahengu gangi gaka bambu nkolongu Ahabu pamu na goti gajagengiki, namuna ejasengiki nu kujipamba nyumba jaki kwa manyelu, na misi joti jejasengiki, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke ya Akabambu Akolongu buku Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabu pajwakuwa buntaga mu matenge gaka hoku baki na mwanamundu Ahazia bunhimika kuba bambu nkolongu badala ja atati baki.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati julongosa ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Mu saka su nsesi su ulongosi waka Ahabu jojabi bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli, Yehoshafati mwana waka Asa, jatumbulia kulongosa ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati jabiya na yaka selasini nu nhwanu pajwatumbulia kulongosa. Jwalongusa ku musi uku Yelusalemu kwa yaka ishilini nu nhwanu. Amabaki baakemika Azuba buku Ashilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Jahenga majambu gaamboni kwaka Bambu Sapanga ngati ebabiya ahengiki atati baki babakema Asa. Lakini ngase jupahalabini pandu pukupiiki matambiku kwi itombi. Bandu baendalai kupiya matambiku hoku nu kupogale ubani pandu hapu. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Najombi Yehoshafati jatama ku lukwali na bambu nkolongu juku Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Mahengu gangi gaka Yehoshafati, makili gaki na ngondu yejukomini, goti gaandikwi mu Kitabu sa Ngombuke ya Akabambu Akolongu buku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Jaaboa mu nndema akanalomi boti bababia agonalene beni na beni, babaigali mu masoba guulongosi waka Asa bababia atati baki.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Tumbuka hapu ngasekwabii na bambu nkolongu ku Edomu. Kilongosi wabu jwabia kilongosi jojahaguliwa na bambu nkolongu Yehoshafati.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Bambu nkolongu Yehoshafati jalenganakia meli yu kujenda ku musi uku Ofili kutoto madini ga zahabu lakini ngaseyahikiki ndaba yatei kuhalabika yahigaliya ku Esioni Gebeli, na ngaseyahenga sapwali kabeti. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Ndienu, Ahazia mwana waka Ahabu, ampwagila Yehoshafati, “Nuguloba atumisi bangu ajenda pamu na atumisi baku mu meli homu.” Lakini Yehoshafati ngasejajetakile lijambu heli.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Najombi Yehoshafati jatenda kuwa, nu kuntaga mu matenge gaka bambu akolongu mu musi uka Daudi, najombi Yeholamu, mwanamundu jwalongusa badala jaki.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazia julongosa ku Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Mu saka sa komi na saba su ulongosi waka Yehoshafati, bambu nkolongu juku Yuda, Ahazia mwana waka Ahabu, jatumbulia kulongosa ku Izilaeli. Jwalongusa kwa yaka ibeli koni jubii ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Najombi Ahazia jatei majambu mabaja palongi jaka Bambu Sapanga, jajiga mahengu gabahenga Ahabu atati baki na ngati ejahenga Yezebeli anyongo baki, na Yelobuamu jojaalongusa Aizilaeli mu kutama kwi kihakau. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Jukitumakia nu kukilumbali kisapanga Baali, anhenga Bambu Sapanga, ngati ebabiya ahengiki Ahabu atati baki. Ndienu Sapanga jwa Aizilaeli jabiya ni inyela kwa kila lijambu.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>